<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- English Practice Project</book>
  <para style="h">1 KORINTIYAWA</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Korintiyawa</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Korintiyawa</para>
  <para style="toc3">1kor</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 Korintiyawa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Amgbasho ata areh anyi na amya, Ablusu. Nnoh a seh meh la meh ti bu kyangwri bleh tsifa nana Yeso Kristi na kira a ŋoh. Tasa atsi ambohroh Sastanisu za a yama na amya atsi leh ŋa ba nnoh reh.<verse eid="1CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />Mya meh tohmoh amgbasho ata areh ba nnoh mohnoh amboh tufa mboh nza ni yama nnoh ma Korinti, mboh amboh ata Nnoh nza a seh mboh a gya fyafya nimeh sa Yeso kristi, tasa za na amboh ata ma a fi mboh mata bu fyafya nimeh sa Yeso Kristi, tasa amboh ata nza ma a leh kwere ma akpokpo atsifi na sa Ada ambohroh Yeso kristi. Ada amoh tasa ambohroh nambri.<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Nnoh Ada ambohroh tasa Ada ambohroh Yeso Kristi ta a lisa nnoh andromboh alindeh tasa tuma alindeh.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablusu A kwende Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Mya meh kǝ kwende ma Nnoh amya ni tutu la tsifa amohnoh, tasa za la tsifa lisa alindeh ata Nnoh nza nga noh reh nimeh sa Yeso Kristi. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />mohnoh nza ni bu noh na Yeso kristi reh, ni hunji noh asabara ma akeki mboh reh atsetse, ma atsi bleh tsifa tasa wina lomo nambri. <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Ma aki wohroh reh, a bleh noh zizi la andromboh ata meh bleh ma ikpi Kristi reh a bu zizi. <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />Nza a bu dehreh mohnoh neh ni sohroh chi nnoh ngǝnga ata huru reh kpeh, tswanza nza ni leh were nnoh iyo bana nnoh ba Ada ambohroh Yeso Kristi reh. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Ada Nnoh ambohroh a nati a nga noh wuwana a gu a na trinaa, la ti kama bu noh amboh kpakpana kpeh ibi ata Ada ambohroh Yeso Kristi nza a nati a gyuru a ba reh. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Nnoh ata ka a bleh ta a lisa reh, a bu ŋoh nza a fi noh la ti dohsoh noh ikpi amohnoh na amehreh a ŋoh Yeso Kristi Ada ambohroh reh.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gafana Nimeh amboh Tufa Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh, meh kwere nnoh nimeh sa Ada ambohroh Yeso Kristi, la aniye amohnoh ta bu anyimbehreh, ti kama tuma noh atsetse kpeh, mohnoh ti dohsoh noh ikpi amohnoh, ti tuma noh na kohnoh anyimbehreh, kohnoh amohnoh za ta bu anyimbehreh. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh, amboh afya Kuluwi mboh ma a bleh meh la ni leh were nnoh gohroh ma itoh amohnoh. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Kohnoh amya reh a bu la: Akyo amohnoh anyi a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Mya meh tufa Ablusu&gt;&gt;; anyi a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh tufa Afolo mi,&gt;&gt; anyi za a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh tufa Kristi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Kristi reh A gafana? Tama a kpa Ablusu reh ma agbeh tsifa amohnoh? Tama a wra nnoh batisma reh nimeh sa Ablusu? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Mya meh kwende Nnoh la a bu Kirisbus tasa Gayus mboh ma mya nza ni wra mboh batisma nimeh amohnoh reh, <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />akyo ta kama a bleh la ma a wra nnoh batisma nimeh sa amya kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />(Meh kira dehreh, mya tini wra batisma ma amboh afya Istifanus mboh, nza bu amboh areh kpeh, meh wina la meh wra batisma ma akyo anyi tse kpeh.) <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Kristi reh a tohmoh meh la meh ti ba ba wra kyangwri mboh batisma kpeh, meh ba neh meh ti hwra tsifa nana bleh mi, a bu na lomo wina bleh tsifa ata kyangwri kpeh, la wuwana Kristi reh ta a bu wusu kpeh.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristi A bu Lomo Tasa wuwana Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Tsifa ata nza ma a mla Yeso a kwo ma gbohrohgboh reh, a bu tsifa duduna na amboh ata nza ma a nati a lofona reh, Mbohroh neh amboh ata nza meh nati nvara reh, a bu na wuwana Nnoh. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Ma a ŋa a gya la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">&lt;&lt;Meh nati lofo lomo amboh ata nza ma a bu na lomo reh;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 1:19">amboh nza ma a nza lomo tsifa a wina reh, ma a nati a wa iya.<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Kyangwri amboh lomo mboh reh ma bu ma? amboh wina amgbasho Musa mboh reh ma bu ma? amboh nza ma wina awumu mboh nambri reh ma bu ma? Nnoh reh a tsana la lomo ata inziyo ata areh a bu ata dudunaa? <verse eid="1CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Nimeh lomo Nnoh reh, inziyo reh a wina Nnoh ma aki lomo a ŋoh reh kpeh, Nnoh neh ka a nza nana ta sa amboh ata nza ma a kira na a ŋoh reh a hwana, nza a bu ma aki bleh tsifa nana ata duduna reh. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Yahudawa mboh ma a kira mata ka a nza kpra awumu mboh, Helenawa mboh ma a fa mata a hunji lomo, <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />Mbohroh neh meh leh hwra tsifa Yeso ata nza ma a kpa ŋoh ma agbeh reh, a bu wohroh nza a de Yahudawa mboh nza ma a kpa hwana reh, tasa a ka a bu andromboh ata duduna na amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />amboh ata Nnoh nza a fi mboh neh, ha ka bu Yahudawa mboh, ha amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh, Kristi reh a bu wuwana Nnoh tasa lomo Nnoh. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Andromboh ata nza ka bu duduna ata Nnoh reh, a keh lomo ata kyangwri, tasa za andromboh ata nza anyina na na Nnoh reh, a keh wuwana ata kyangwri.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />ambohroh mboh, kohnoh nnoh na ameh ata Nnoh ta ka a fi noh reh, a bu mohnoh shidi ma inziyo nza a nza la ni bu noh na lomo reh, tasa za a bu mohnoh shidi ma nza ni de noh kpra agbugba reh, tasa za a bu mohnoh shidi ma nza ni bu noh mara agbugba kyangwri reh. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Nnoh neh a seh awumu amboh duduna mboh ma inziyo areh la mata a nga sa ma amboh ata nza ma a bu na lomo reh; Nnoh a seh awumu amboh ata nza ma anyinana ma inziyo areh la mata a nga sa ma amboh ata nza ma wuwana reh. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Nnoh reh a seh andromboh ata kyangwri mboh nza ma a gu la a zohhoh kpeh reh a rina, ma a gu la a bu andromboh kpeh, la mata a nasa andromboh ata inziyo nza a gu la a zohhoh reh, <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />la akyo anyi ta a kama a gu ikpi a ŋoh a ka la ŋoh wa a keh mgbiri mboh kpeh <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />A bu tsifa Nnoh mohnoh nza ni bu noh nimeh Yeso Kristi reh, a bu Nnoh za nza a bleh Yeso ta bu lomo na ambohroh reh, ma aki a ŋoh za Mbohroh meh hunji tufa yehlehleh, tasa zanana tasa nvara. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />nehnehreh, tswanza nza ma a ŋa nimeh amgbasho Nnoh reh la, &lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a nati ava ivoh ma agohsoh reh, ta ava ivoh ma agohsoh nimeh Nnoh mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />ambohroh mboh, ameh ata meh ti kǝ ba leh bleh noh tsifa ayuhu ata Nnoh nza a bleh reh, meh kama bleh noh tsifa reh na wina tsifa amya ha na lomo kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Mya meh gu ma agohsoh amya la, ameh ata mya nza ni nati tuma na amohnoh reh, meh nati za tsana andromboh za kpeh, a nati a ka bu tsifa Yeso Kristi reh tsene ma ta ka a kpa ŋoh ma gbohrohgboh reh. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Mya meh ti kǝ jiji ba na amohnoh reh, meh tini bu na wuwana kpeh meh kǝ leh nyiri itoh tsifa nyiri. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />Tsifa amya tasa hwra tsifa amya reh, ma a gya agohsoh na tsifa lomo ha ata kohkoh tsifa kpeh, neh mata a gya agohsoh na tsifa bleh gya ata huru tsana reh. <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />La gya agohsoh amohnoh ta kama a bu na lomo kyangwri mboh kpeh, ta ka a bu na wuwana Nnoh mi.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lomo Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Dehreh za, Mbohroh meh kǝ bleh tsifa lomo na amboh ata maa a te agba nimeh gya agohsoh amoh na Nnoh reh, lomo reh neh a bu ata ameh ata areh kpeh, ha neh ata amboh de kpra amboh ameh ata areh kpeh, ata nza a nati a za bu andromboh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Mbohroh neh meh bleh tsifa lomo Nnoh ata nza a bu ma huho reh, lomo reh a bu ata ma ta ka a huho reh, nza a bu lomo ata Nnoh nza a lisa a gya anyi ma jiji reh la mata a nga reh agba. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Nimeh amboh ata nza ma a de kpra nehnehreh reh, akyo a kama a wina lomo ata areh kpeh, maka a bleh la ma a wina reh, mboh reh tama a sohroh a kpa Ada agba reh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Tswanza nza ma a ŋa ma amgbasho Nnoh reh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">&lt;&lt; iyo kǝ hehreh nza kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">ashotoh kǝ hehreh sehreh kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">akyo kǝ hehreh kohnoh nza kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">andromboh ata Nnoh nza a lisa ma amboh ata nza ma a kira na a ŋoh reh&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Nnoh neh ka a vuru a tsana reh awumu mboh reh nimeh huru a ŋoh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 2:10">Huru reh ka fa akeki mboh reh nambri, tasa awumu Nnoh ata nza a bu na iya wina reh. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />A bu anyi nimeh kyangwri a wina kohnoh ata nza a bu nimeh agohsoh kyangwri, ata nza bu huru nimeh kyangwri reh kpeh? Ma aki wohroh za akyo a wina kohnoh Nnoh kpeh, a bu huru Nnoh tsene ma. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Mbohroh meh sohroh sa huru ata inziyo areh kpeh, a bu huru ata neh nza anyi na Nnoh, la Mbohroh meh ti wina awumu ata Nnoh nza a nga reh were ma reh. <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Mbohroh meh leh bleh noh awumu amboh areh, a bu tsifa ata nza ma a leh a tsana reh na lomo kyangwri reh kpeh, a bu ata huru mi, ata nza ma a tsana awumu huru ata a zizi mboh reh ma amboh ata nza ma a bu na huru reh. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Kyangwri ata nza a bu na huru kpeh, a nati a wina sa awumu huru ata nza anyi na Nnoh reh kpeh, na a ŋoh reh a bu duduna, a nati a za a nza a wina kpeh, ka a bu ma aki huru maka a nza a wina. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Kyangwri ata nza a bu na huru Nnoh reh, ka a nza awumu mboh reh nambri a wina, amboh ata neh nza ma a bu na huru Nnoh kpeh reh, ma a nati a wina nza andromboh a wina kpeh.<verse eid="1CO 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />&lt;&lt;A bu anyi nza a wina kohnoh Ada reh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:16">la ta a tsana ŋoh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Mbohroh neh kohnoh ambohroh a bu Kristi a ŋoh.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Gafana Nimeh Ida Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />ambohroh mboh, mya meh za wina bleh noh tsifa tswanza amboh ata huru Nnoh nza a bu na amoh reh za kpeh, meh bleh noh tswanza amboh agohsoh ata kyangwri inziyo mboh nza ma tswanza amehreh akǝkehreh nimeh Kristi reh. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Meh tini fyoh nnoh na amwo behneh, a bu rya ata nza a wuwana kpeh, la ni hehreh tswa ti rya nnoh rya reh ameh wohroh kpeh, nehnehreh za ni hehreh tswa ti rya nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />Ni tre bu noh tswanza amboh ata nza ma a wina Nnoh kpeh reh, nza ni bu noh na vene tasa za ti leh were nnoh gohroh na itoh amohnoh, ni tre bu noh na agohsoh kyangwri, ni leh lisa nnoh tswanza amboh ata nza ma a wina Nnoh kpeh reh. <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Nza akyo anyi a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Meh tufa Ablusu,&gt;&gt; tasa anyi za la, &lt;&lt;Meh tufa Afolo,&gt;&gt; Ni tsifa nnoh tswanza amboh ata nza ma a wina Nnoh kpeh reh.<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Nehnehreh, anyi ka bu Ablusu? tasa anyi ka bu Afolo? Mbohroh reh meh bu ahwra ma, amboh ata mohnoh nza ni nga nnoh kira amohnoh mboh ma aki tsana amoh reh, anyi ma na ndohmoh ata Nnoh nza a nga ŋoh? <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />A tswanza mya meh biya biroh, Afolo neh ka a were amwo, Nnoh neh ka soh ivoh ka a te agba. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Nza a bu dehreh akyo ata nza a biya ha akyo ata nza a were amwo reh ma a bu andromboh kpeh. a bu Nnoh tsene ma nza ka a de awumu mboh a te agba reh. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Kyangwri ata nza a biya tasa kyangwri ata nza a were amwo reh ma bu na kohnoh anyimbehreh, anyima a nati a hunji firoh ndohmoh a ŋoh yehlehleh <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Mbohroh reh meh bu ziza ndohmoh Nnoh mboh, mohnoh reh ni bu noh tswanza aye Nnoh, ni bu noh tswanza mina Nnoh za.<verse eid="1CO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Ma aki andromboh alindeh ata Nnoh nza a nga meh reh, meh gya chuhu ida reh tswanza kyangwri wina mina, akyo anyi tse a gyuru a leh mina ma a huru. amboh mina mboh reh mata a lisa a nza biroh mina nza ma a nati a mina ma a huru reh. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Akyo anyi a nati a wina gya chuhu ida a keh ata maa a gya reh kpeh, wohroh reh a bu Yeso Kristi. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Nza akyo anyi a mina ma chuhu mina reh na kpakpa hungroh atisha, ha atasaa, ha kpakpa ata nza bu hungroh ma, ha agbeh, ha kokro, ha bini, <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />Nnoh a nati a tsana biroh ndohmoh alindeh ata kyangwri mboh nza ma a te reh. A nati a tsana ibi ata Kristi reh nza a nati a gyuru a ba reh. Shira a nati a yama ibi wohroh, tasa za shira a nati a tsara biroh ndohmoh ata kyangwri nza a lisa reh. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Nza mina ata nza ma a mina ma chuhu ida reh afiya shira kpeh, kyangwri mina reh a nati a hunji firoh a ŋoh. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Nza ndohmoh akyo ata nza afiya shira reh, ndohmoh a ŋoh reh a zohhoh kpeh. Kyangwri ata nza a te ndohmoh reh a nati a hunji kpeh. Nnoh a nati nga nvara ma kyangwri reh. Kyangwri wohroh reh neh a nati a tswanza akyo ata nza a gbo nimeh shira a na atsi ata shira nza a yama kpeh reh<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />A zohhoh ti wina noh la mohnoh reh ni bu noh ida Nnoh. A zohhoh ti wina noh za la huru Nnoh reh a tuma nimeh amohnoh. <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Akyo ata nza a kputu ida Nnoh reh, Nnoh za a nati a lofo akyo wohroh; ida Nnoh reh a zanana ma, a bu mohnoh nza ni bu noh afiya Nnoh reh.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Akyo ta kama a landa ikpi a ŋoh kpeh. Nza akyo anyi nimeh amohnoh a gu ikpi a ŋoh la ŋoh bu na lomo, a tswanza inziyo nza a bu na lomo reh, ŋoh reh ta a gu ikpi a ŋoh tswanza a duduna reh, ŋoh neh a nati ka a hunji lomo. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Lomo ata inziyo areh a bu duduna ma tohmoh Nnoh. Tswanza nza ma a ŋa a gya reh la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh reh ka a de amboh ata nza ma a bu na lomo reh na wina amoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Tasa za, &lt;&lt;Ada a wina la kohnoh ata amboh lomo mboh reh a bu wusu ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Nza a bu dehreh, akyo anyi ta kama ava ivoh ma agohsoh na kyangwri kpeh! awumu mboh reh ma bu amohnoh nambri, <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />Ha Ablusu, ha Afolo, ha Kefas, ha inziyo, ha fene, ha kwo, ha awumu amboh ata nehnehreh, ha amboh ata ma a treh ma tohmoh, ma bu amohnoh nambri. <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />mohnoh ni bu noh ata Kristi, Kristi za a bu Nnoh a ŋoh.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s">amboh Bleh Tsifa Nana Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Ma aki wohroh reh, a zohhoh mata a wina reh la mya tasa Afolo meh bu amboh te ndohmoh Kristi, amboh te ndohmoh ayuhu ata Nnoh nza a nga mboh reh. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Nza a gu a ba a te nehnehreh, akyo ata nza ma a nga ŋoh ndohmoh, a zohhoh ta bu kyangwri tsana awumu yehlehleh. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />A bu andromboh akehreh ma na amya ti tsara meh noh nza, ha neh ti tsara meh noh na nza kyangwri, mya meh tsara ikpi amya kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Mya meh wina la meh bu na kpakpana kpeh, ata areh a nati a ha la mata a hunji meh na kpakpana kpeh. A bu Ada a nati a wina tsara meh a nza. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Nza a bu dehreh, kama shimba nnoh akpi ma ikpi akyo neh ameh kǝ hehreh ba kpeh. Bana nnoh Ada ta a gyuru a ba feh. A bu ŋoh a nati a tsana reh awumu amboh ata nza ma a huho nimeh shini reh, a nati a vuru kohnoh ma agohsoh kyangwri mboh. A bu ma a huru anyima a nati a hunji riri anyi na Nnoh yehlehleh.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Nehnehreh, ambohroh mboh, meh bleh noh tsifa mboh reh nambri ma ikpi amya tasa Afolo reh tsifa amohnoh, la ti nza nyi nnoh na ambohroh la, &lt;&lt;Kama gǝga handa nnoh andromboh ata nza ma a ŋa nimeh amgbasho reh kpeh,&gt;&gt; Akyo amohnoh anyi ta kama a bleh la agba kyangwri ndohmoh Nnoh anyi a keh atohngoh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />A bu anyi ata nza a bleh la nnoh ni keh mgbiri reh? A bu mboh ata nza ni bu na wohroh ata nza bu Nnoh nza a nga noh kpeh reh? Nnoh za ma a nga noh awumu mboh mi, a bu mboh a te feh ni leh gu ikpi anzoh ka tswanza ma a nga noh awumu reh kpeh?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />mohnoh ni kohnoh nnoh la ni bu noh na awumu mboh reh nambri ata nza ni kira nnoh reh! Ni kohnoh nnoh za la ni bu noh na asabara! Ni de noh kpra Agohmoh ata Mbohroh meh sohroh wina kpeh! Ma a bleh la ni de noh kpra Agohmoh reh zizi, Mbohroh za meh ti de Mbohroh ma amohnoh! <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Ni nza amya, Nnoh reh a tsana a kate ma inziyo la mbohroh amboh ble tsifa nana mboh reh meh bu ma nyina awumu mboh reh nambri, tswanza amboh ata nza ma ahwra akpi la ma a nati a kwo, la mbohroh timi tsana ma inziyo nambri, tasa mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh tasa kyangwri mboh. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Mbohroh meh duduna tsifa Kristi, mohnoh neh ni bu noh na lomo nimeh Kristi! Mbohroh meh bu na wuwana kpeh, mohnoh neh ni bu noh na wuwana! Maka nga noh agba, mbohroh neh maka a nza reh a rina! <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Nehnehreh inyo a buti a keh reh tasa yohroh amwo, kuri ambohroh mboh maa a te atono, kyangwri maka a mla reh, meh sohroh bu na afiya kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />Mbohroh meh leh te ndohmoh na ikpi ambohroh, nza ma a kya reh, mbohroh meh kǝ bleh Nnoh ta a te mboh atoh, nza ma nga reh iya reh, mbohroh meh kǝ de ikpi ahroh. <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />Nza kyangwri mboh ma a bleh tsifa abibi ma ikpi ambohroh reh, Mbohroh meh kǝ bleh mboh tsifa kuku agohsoh. A tswanza Mbohroh reh meh bu atsi sangra avuvu ata inziyo areh, andromboh ata kyangwri nza ma a sehreh,<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Mya meh ŋa ba nnoh la meh ti nga nnoh na sa kpeh, mya neh meh ŋa nnoh la meh ti kpi nnoh ashotoh tsifa la ni bu noh mara amya mboh ata mya nza ni kira. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Nza ni bu noh na amboh tsana gaga nza ma a bu nimeh Kristi, ni bu noh na Ada mboh gaga kpeh, mya meh bu Atsiyoh amohnoh nimeh Kristi ma atsi bleh tsifa nana reh. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Nza a bu dehreh, meh kwere nnoh la ti nza nyi nnoh na amya. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />A bu tsifa ata areh, mya meh tohmoh Timoti ba na amohnoh, ŋoh a bu amehreh amya ata mya meh kira na a ŋoh, a bu kyangwri bleh zizi nimeh Kristi, a nati a kohnoh nnoh ma aki amya ata mya nza ni bu nimeh Yeso Kristi reh, ata nza a kira na andromboh ata mya nza ni leh tsana noh ma ida nnoh mboh reh nambri.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Mgbiri amohnoh mboh ma a leh a gu ikpi a ka, tswanza meh nati gyuru ba na amohnoh za kpeh reh. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Mya neh meh nati yanda kpeh meh nati gyuru ba na amohnoh, nza Nnoh a kira reh, meh nati fa nza meh ti nza wuwana amboh gu ikpi a ka mboh reh, a bu ma ikpi tsifa amoh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Kpra Agohmoh Nnoh reh a bu tsifa aniye kpeh, a bu tsifa wuwana. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Nehnehreh, a bu tsifa atamaa ni nati gu nnoh? Meh nati ba na amohnoh na ikpoh ha neh meh ti ba na amohnoh na huru kira?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s1">Katsi Atsi tsifa Leh Ahohndoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Meh sere la tsifa leh ahohndoh a yama ma hohroh amohnoh, ikata ha amboh ata nza ma a wina Nnoh kpeh maka a lisa dehreh kpeh, la akyo anyi a de afya alehmeh a te tswanza ka a bu afya a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Tasa ni kǝ rya nnoh itoh, Ni ti kputu nnoh yira amohnoh, ti katsi nnoh akyo ata nza a lisa andromboh ika ata areh nyi ma hohroh amohnoh kpeh? <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />La meh bu na amohnoh ma itoh kpeh, meh bu na amohnoh nimeh huru. Nimeh sa Ada ambohroh Yeso meh tini hwra akpi ma kyangwri ata nza a lisa andromboh reh tswanza meh yama. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Nza ni dohsohna nnoh, huru amya za a yama na amohnoh, tasa za wuwana Ada ambohroh Yeso, <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />Gu nnoh kyangwri ika wohroh nga nnoh ma agugu, la ta a mla itoh a ŋoh, huru a ŋoh ta anvara Ibi ata Ada reh. <verse eid="1CO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Rya itoh amohnoh ata nza kǝ lisa nnoh reh a bu andromboh alindeh kpeh. Ni wina noh la ameh yisti akehreh a ka a de afohfohnoh ashwi nambri na agba ma kpeh? <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Gu nnoh atono yisti ata kpakpana reh kate nnoh, ti bu noh yisti afeh kpikpingri, tasa za a bu dehreh mi ni bu noh. Tama a fa Ameh Atashi ambohroh ata dohsoh ikpi handa, ka bu Yeso Kristi. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Nza ka bu dehreh, meh kǝ kira ambohroh, ta a bu na afohfohnoh ata nza a bu na yisti atono kpeh, yisti ata a de agohsoh tasa ata te nyi kpeh, ta a bu na afohfohnoh ata nza a bu na yisti kpeh, ta a bu afohfohnoh ata te alindeh tasa zizi.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Meh ŋa ba nnoh nimeh amgbasho amya la kama dohsoh noh ikpi na amboh agohsoh leh ahohndoh reh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />A sohroh bu la meh bleh amboh agohsoh leh ahohndoh ata inziyo areh kpeh, ha amboh vu, ha amboh te ayuhu, ha tufa Nnoh ata wusu mboh. Nza ma ta a bu dehreh ni nati kate nyi nnoh nimeh inziyo kanga. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Nehnehreh neh meh buti ŋa ba nnoh la ti kama dohsoh noh ikpi ma amboh nza maka a fi mboh la ma a bu amboh tufa nza ŋoh bu kyangwri leh ahohndoh, ha a bu kyangwri vu, ha a bu kyangwri tufa Nnoh wusu mboh, ha kyangwri kya, ha kyangwri wa te fya, kyangwri te ayuhu, kama mishi rya nnoh rya ma amboh ika ata areh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Bu mboh a wa meh aniye meh ti hwra akpi ma amboh nza ma a bu ambohroh kpeh? A bu amboh nza ma a yama nimeh ida Nnoh ni nati hwra mboh nnoh akpi kpeh? <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />A ka a bu Nnoh mi ka ahwra akpi ma amboh nza ma a bu ambohroh kpeh.&gt;&gt; Katsi kyangwri agugu kate nyi nnoh nimeh amohnoh. &lt;&lt;<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s1">amboh Tufa Mboh Kama Fi Nnoh Aniye Itoh Amohnoh Kpeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Nza akyo amohnoh anyi a kira ta a fi aniye atohngoh a ŋoh, a nati te ni sa ta a de ŋoh a na atsi hwra akpi na amboh nza ma bu amboh tufa mboh kpeh? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Ni wina nza noh la a nati bu amboh tufa Nnoh mboh ma a nati ahwra akpi ma kyangwri inziyo mboh nambri kpeh? Nza ni nati hwra noh akpi ma kyangwri inziyo mboh, ni tswa nnoh ti tuma tsifa nnoh ma ikpi tsifa mboh akǝkehreh kpeh? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Ni wina noh la mbohroh meh nati wina hwra akpi ma mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh kpeh? La mata a bleh la tsifa inziyo areh? <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Nza ni bu noh ni tsifa mboh ika ata areh, a bu lele feh ni kǝ gu mboh na atsi amboh ma a tswa andromboh kpeh nimeh kyangwri amboh tufa mboh mata ahwra mboh akpi? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Meh bleh noh dehreh la ta a te nnoh ni sa, la, akyo wina lomo anyimbehreh a yama nimeh amohnoh ata nza a nati wina suhru nnoh ma atsi mboh nza ma a kputuna? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Nza a bu dehreh neh, atsi ka a gu atsini a na ma ida hwra akpi, la za ma tohmoh amboh nza ma bu amboh tufa mboh Nnoh kpeh! <verse eid="1CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Fi aniye itoh amohnoh nza ni kǝ lisa nnoh reh, a bu nyinana mi na amohnoh. A tswa ti soh nnoh ivoh yira kpeh? ha la ti ta mata a rya nnoh ha mata a ha nnoh andromboh ata nza a bu anzoh reh kpeh? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Nza nnoh neh, mohnoh ni ikpi amohnoh ni kǝ rya nnoh ikpi amohnoh ni kǝ kputu nnoh ikpi amohnoh, za ni kǝ lisa nnoh ma itoh amohnoh mboh! <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Ni wina noh kpeh la amboh nza ma a lisa yehlehleh kpeh ma a nati nza Nnoh kpeh? Ma a kama a landa nnoh kpeh la amboh agohsoh kputu atsifi, ha amboh tufa Nnoh wusu, ha amboh leh ahohndoh, ha atsifa ta leh na tsifa mboh, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />ha amboh te ayuhu ha amboh vu ha amboh wa tefya ha amboh kya mboh ha amboh sa awumu hwana, akyo amoh anyi ata nza a nati nza Nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />A bu dehreh mgbiri amohnoh tswa tama a bu ni kiri, Neh ma a hwara nnoh, ma a gu nnoh a gya amboh zanana ni Nnoh, ma a gu nnoh a gya amboh nza ma a bu na kpakpana kpeh ma tohmoh Nnoh nimeh sa Ada Yeso Kristi, tasa za huru Nnoh ambohroh.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kama Leh ahohndoh Kpeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />&gt;&gt; Awumu mboh nambri, ma nga meh kira&lt;&lt;, Awumu mboh neh bu nambri ma a zohhoh kpeh.&gt;&gt; Awumu mboh nambri, ma nga meh&lt;&lt;, Mya neh meh nati tuma ahwra ma andromboh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />&gt;&gt;Irya bu tsifa yira ma a lisa ŋoh, yira za bu tsifa rya, &lt;&lt; Nnoh neh a nati lofo na afri ma, areh tasa ata ari. Itoh reh bu tsifa leh ahohndoh kpeh, a bu tsifa Ada, Ada za bu tsifa itoh. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Nnoh a yiri Ada nyi ma kwo, mbohroh za ma nati a yiri reh nimeh wuwana a ŋoh. <verse eid="1CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Ni sohroh wina noh la, itoh amohnoh bu mgbiri itoh Kristi kpeh? Ha meh ti gyuru gu mgbiri itoh Yeso te mgbiri itoh angra? mbimbi kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Ni sohroh wina noh la akyo ata nza a dohsoh itoh na angra itoh amoh kǝ bu itoh anyimbehreh kpeh? Tama a ŋa la, &gt;&gt;Mboh afri ma nati bu itoh anyimbehreh.&lt;&lt; <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Akyo ata nza a dohsoh ikpi a ŋoh na Ada neh ma a bu anyimbehreh ma a ŋoh nimeh huru. <verse eid="1CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Ta nnoh agohsoh leh ahohndoh. Kpakpana mboh nambri kyangwri nza ka a lisa ka a bara itoh ŋoh kpeh, akyo leh ahohndoh neh a ka gu kpakpana ma itoh a ŋoh. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Ni sohroh wina noh la itoh amohnoh bu ida Huru Zanana, ata nza a yama nimeh amohnoh, ata nza anyi na Nnoh kpeh? Ni bu noh ata ikpi amohnoh kpeh; <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />tama a sa noh na firoh, ta maka a fanga. Tsifa wohroh nga nnoh agba ma Nnoh na itoh amohnoh.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s1">Tsifa Sa Afya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Ma ikpi tsifa andromboh ata ti kǝ ŋa ba meh noh reh: a zohhoh kyangwri ta a tuma a bu na afya kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Neh meh gbo tsifa hende leh ahohndoh na ma reh, kyangwri ta a bu na afya a ŋoh, afya ta a bu na atsifa a ŋoh, tasa za ha bu afya atamaa ta a bu na atsifa a ŋoh. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Atsifa ta a kama a ha afya kpeh, afya ta a kama a ha atsifa a ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Tsifa la afya a bu na wuwana ata ikpi a ŋoh kpeh a bu atsifa mi, dehreh za atsifa a ŋoh a bu na wuwana na itoh a ŋoh kpeh, afya neh ka a bu na wohroh. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Akyo amohnoh anyi ta a leke anyi kpeh, nza a bu na kira amohnoh feh, gu na ta kama a yanda la ti bu noh zuzuhru atsi kwere nnoh Nnoh si gyuru dohsohna nnoh. Agugu ta a kama a landa nnoh kpeh ti de noh ikpi amohnoh. <verse eid="1CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Areh meh zakǝ bleh ma, a bu la meh nga nnoh aniye kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Mata a bleh la kyangwri mboh reh nambri ma a tswanza mya reh, kyangwri mboh reh ma bu na ngǝnga ma asaa ata Nnoh nza a nga mboh, akyo anyi a bu na ika ata areh, akyo anyi a bu na ika ata ari.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Na amboh nza ma a hehreh a sa itoh amoh kpeh tasa ifiya kunu mboh meh bleh mboh la: A zohhoh mata a tuma dehreh, tswanza mya nza meh tuma dehreh reh. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Nza ma nati wina de ikpi amoh kpeh neh, a zohhoh mata sa itoh amoh. A keh zohhoh mata sa itoh amoh la ta a te a huya ata nza a nati a keh wuwana ikpi kyangwri. <verse eid="1CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />amboh nza ma sa itoh amoh neh, meh nga nnoh aniye, a bu mya kpeh, a bu Ada, la, afya ta a kama a gbo ata atsifa a ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />Nza ka a gbo ata ŋoh reh neh, ta ka a tuma dehreh, iri wohroh ta a za a gyuru a ba a kira na atsifa a ŋoh reh yama, atsifa za ta a kama katsi afya a ŋoh kpeh.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Na mgbiri amohnoh, meh bleh mboh, a bu Ada kpeh, nza atsi amohnoh anyi a bu na afya ata nza a tufa Nnoh kpeh, a kira la mata a tuma ma a ŋoh, ta a kama a yi ŋoh ata kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Nza bu afya a bu na atsifa ata nza a tufa Nnoh kpeh, ka kira la mata a tuma mboh ma a ŋoh ta a kama a yi ŋoh ata kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Meh bleh dehreh, la, atsifa ata nza a nga agohsoh kpeh kǝ te hwaraa ma aki nza ma a bu anyimbehreh mboh ma afya a ŋoh reh, dehreh za afya ata nza a nga agohsoh kpeh, kǝ te hwara, ma aki nza ma a bu anyimbehreh mboh ma atsifa a ŋoh reh. ma a bu dehreh kpeh mara amohnoh mboh ma a bu arishi ma, nehnehreh neh maka a te amboh hwara ŋoh. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Ata nza a tufa Nnoh kpeh reh neh ka a kira la ŋoh a na a ŋoh a yi ata nza ka a tufa Nnoh reh ata, haa, ta ka na a ŋoh. Ma atsi areh, atsi ha asra amboh tufa Nnoh a bu kanga kpeh, tsifa la Nnoh a fi reh a ba ma tuma alindeh. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Nnoh afya ni wina lele la ha bu noh ni nati lisa atsifa anzoh ta anvara? Nnoh atsifa, ni wina lele la ha bu noh ni nati lisa afya anzoh ta anvara?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Ma anyi anyi ma amohnoh ni bu noh na andromboh ata Ada nza nga noh reh. tuma noh dehreh, rya nnoh tohmoh dehreh tswanza Nnoh nza a seh nnoh ma anyi anyi ti fene nnoh. meh tsana aki ata areh ma ida Nnoh mboh a treh atsifi nambri. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Akyo ata Nnoh nza a fi ŋoh, ata ni kiri tana a bu na anvu kpa, ta a kama a fa la mata a shimba ŋoh kpa kpeh, Akyo ata Nnoh nza a fi ŋoh, ata ni kiri tama a shimba ŋoh kpa, ta a kama a fa la ŋoh ta a bu na anvu kpa kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Shimba kpa ha shimba kpa kpeh wohroh bu andromboh kpeh, de noh tsifa Nnoh reh ma. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Anyi anyi ma amohnoh tuma noh tswanza Nnoh nza a fi ŋoh reh. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Nza tini bu ahwra na ameh mata ka a fi noh reh, nza ni nati wina hunji mata ata nnoh avoh, lisa dehreh. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Akyo ata ta ka a bu ahwra na ameh ma ta ka a fi ŋoh a ba na Ada reh, a bu ahwra za kpeh, ŋoh bu ata Ada a ŋoh mi. a bu dehreh za akyo ata nza ma a fi ŋoh na ameh ata ma a de ŋoh kpeh, a bu ahwra ata Kristi. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Yeso tana sa reh na firoh kwo a ŋoh ma gbohrohgboh. tsifa wohroh kama te nnoh ahwra mboh ma akyo anyi tse za kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Atsi ambohroh mboh, agohsoh kyangwri nza a bu nimeh na ameh nza ma a fi ŋoh, ta ka a tuma dehreh na Nnoh.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Ma ikpi amboh nza ma a hehreh a sa itoh amoh kpeh, Ada a nga meh aniye kpeh, mya neh meh bleh noh agohsoh amya la, mya ata nza ma a nga ŋoh kira, nimeh nza kwini ata Ada. <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Meh kohnoh la a zohhoh kyangwri ta a tuma avoh ŋoh nza a yama reh, tsifa la nehnehreh a bu ameh iya. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Nza ni sa afya, kama shimba rishi sa afya reh kpeh. nza ni hehreh sa afya kpeh, kama fa anyi kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Nza ni sa afya neh, ni sohroh gu tsifa kpeh, a bu kpakpana kpeh, tasa nza anyifa a sa atsifa, a bu a kpakpana kpeh. amboh nza ma a sa ma a nati a wa iya nimeh inziyo areh, tasa meh ti kehsheh nnoh ma aki dehreh. <verse eid="1CO 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Andromboh nza meh tsana reh, atsi mboh, a bu la ameh ata nza ma a tsara a gya reh wa ba hwiri ta a trina. Nyi nehnehreh, amboh nza ma a sa tama a gu tswanza ma a sa kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />amboh kpanga kwo tswanza ma a bu na hungwa agohsoh kpeh, amboh agohsoh amoh nza a kasa za tswanza ma bu na kasa agohsoh kpeh, amboh sa awumu tswanza ma a bu na andromboh kpeh, <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />amboh te ndohmoh na awumu ata inziyo za ma a kama a gya agohsoh na amoh kpeh, inziyo reh nza a bu, waka a gǝga a na ŋoh. <verse eid="1CO 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Meh kira ti hunji noh inyo nyi ma kohnoh. Kyangwri nza a bu na afya kpeh a ka a fi ikpi ma ndohmoh Nnoh gaga, ta a nza la lele Ada ta a nza nana a ŋoh. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Kyangwri ata nza sa afya neh a ka nga ikpi a ŋoh ma awumu ata inziyo, ta a nza la afya a ŋoh ta a nza nana. <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />Kohnoh a ŋoh a greshina a te afri. tasa afya ata nza a bu na atsifa kpeh, ha anyifa, a ka a nga ikpi a ŋoh ma ndohmoh Ada gaga la ŋoh ta kyangwri zanana nimeh itoh tasa huru. afya ata nza a bu na atsifa neh a ka a nga ikpi a ŋoh ma awumu ata inziyo, la ŋoh ta a nza la atsifa a ŋoh ta a nza nana. <verse eid="1CO 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Meh buti bleh areh la ta a zohhoh nnoh, meh fla nnoh kpeh, neh ti tufa nnoh aki Ada yehlehleh la kohnoh amohnoh ta a kama a greshina kpeh, <verse eid="1CO 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Mata a bleh neh la, akyo ma atsifa a gya mboh ma anyifa anyi ata nza tswa ti sa, tasa za a kohnoh la ŋoh a ka a lisa ŋoh andromboh ata nza a zohhoh kpeh, neh a kira na a ŋoh gaga, ta ka a sa ŋoh. nza a bu dehreh, a bu kpakpana kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Kyangwri ata nza a shi a wuwana ma ikpi kohnoh agohsoh a ŋoh, andromboh reh ma a nati a sohroh a de ŋoh na wuwana kpeh, tasa nza ta a wina de ikpi a ŋoh, ta ka a gu ma agohsoh a ŋoh la ŋoh a nati a sa ŋoh kpeh, areh za a bu yehlehleh. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Ma a huru akyo ata nza a sa anyifa reh a lisa yehlehleh, neh akyo ata nza a sa ŋoh kpeh a lisa a keh zohhoh. <verse eid="1CO 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Afya a nati a yi atsifa ata kpeh nza a yama na fene, nza atsifa reh neh kǝ kwo, a nati wina sa akyo ata agohsoh a ŋoh nza a kira, ata neh nza ka a tufa Ada. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Nza mya la, a nati a keh a hunji nana agohsoh nza ta a tuma dehreh. tasa mya za meh bu na huru ata Nnoh reh.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Irya Ata Nza ma Lisa A nga Ma A soh mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Ma ikpi amgbasho ti kǝ ŋa ba nnoh tsifa rya ata nza maka a lisa a nga a soh mboh reh, meh wina la nambri ma ambohroh meh bu na lomo. lomo neh ka de gu ikpi a ka a ba, kira neh a ka a mina a ka. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />kyangwri ata nza a kohnoh la ŋoh a wina andromboh kǝ hehreh wina andromboh gaga kpeh tswanza ŋoh ta wina. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Akyo ata nza a kira Nnoh neh, Nnoh a wina ŋoh. <verse eid="1CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Ma ikpi rya rya nza maka nga ma a soh wusu mboh reh neh, meh wina la, ma inziyo areh nambri, a soh wusu bu andromboh kyar kpeh, meh wina za la Nnoh bu anyimbehreh ma, anyi a za a yama kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Ha a bu dehreh amboh anyi ma a yama maka a fi mboh la &gt;&gt;A soh mboh&lt;&lt; Ma inza ha ma inzi, tsifa la a soh mboh reh ma a yama mboh ma ada amoh mboh gaga, <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />Na ambohroh neh a bu Nnoh anyimbehreh ma, a yama, Ada reh. Awumu mboh reh nambri anyi na a ŋoh tasa meh tuma tsifa a ŋoh, Ada nza a bu anyimbehreh, Yeso kristi, ata awumu mboh nambri anyi na a ŋoh, Mbohroh meh nyi na a ŋoh meh tuma a ŋoh. <verse eid="1CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />A bu kyangwri mboh nambri ma a wina ata areh kpeh. Mgbiri kyangwri mboh ma a treh a gu ma agohsoh amoh la bu tsifa krumusu a soh wusu maka a kohnoh rya mboh nza ma a rya reh a bu ata a soh wusu a ŋoh. Kohnoh amoh kǝ hehreh wuwana kpeh, ma a gu la mboh maka a te arishi ma aki rya ata areh, maka a kohnoh. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Irya a nati de reh a ba nda na Nnoh kpeh. nza meh rya kpeh, meh nati nyinana kpeh, tasa nza meh rya, meh nati mangara kpeh.<verse eid="1CO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />mohnoh neh lisa nza noh feh la, rya ata areh nza ma a nga noh kira reh ta a bu andromboh ata nza a nati a de hwa a ba ma amboh nza ma a wuwana nimeh nga agohsoh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Tsifa la nza akyo mboh ma a nza noh, ata nza ni wina, ni kǝ rya rya ma bagadi a soh wusu mboh, areh ma a nati a nza dehreh mboh za mata a rya rya ata nza ma a nga a soh wusu reh, nza la ma a hehreh a wuwana kpeh? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Ma aki ata wina anzoh reh a nati de hwa a ba ma atsi anyi, ata Kristi nza a kwo tsifa a ŋoh. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Ma aki wohroh ni kǝ kpakpana nnoh ma Kristi, ni kǝ de iya ba mboh nnoh tsifa la ma a wina andromboh ata nza a zohhoh tasa andromboh ata nza a bu abibi kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Nza a bu tsifa rya rya a nati a de atsi anzoh ta a kpa hwana, meh nati mishi rya wo za kpeh tsifa la ta a kama a de atsi amya ta kpa hwana a hwa kpeh.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Tuma Ikpi Ablusu Kyangwri Sa Tohmoh Nana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Mya reh meh bu na tuma ikpi amya kpeh? Mya reh meh bu kyangwri sa tohmoh nana Yeso bleh kpeh? Ha mya reh meh sohroh nza Yeso Ada ambohroh reh kpeh? A bu mohnoh ni bu noh firoh ndohmoh amya nimeh Ada reh kpeh? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Nza mya meh bu kyangwri bleh tsifa nana Yeso ma mgbiri kpeh, mya meh bu kyangwri bleh tsifa nana a ŋoh na amohnoh tsifa la a bu mohnoh ni nati bu noh kpra la mya reh meh bu kyangwri bleh tsifa nana Ada.<verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Nza kyangwri ma a bleh tsifa abibi ma ikpi amya, meh kǝ sa mboh aniye la: <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Mbohroh meh tswa meh ti bu na wuwana ata rya tasa ata wa kpeh? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Mbohroh meh tswa meh ti wa afiya ambohroh de, tswanza mgbiri amboh sa tsifa nana Yeso a bleh za reh, tasa atsini Ada mboh, tasa Kefas. <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Ha a bu mya tasa Barnaba ma, meh nati te ndohmoh ti meh rya irya na ikpi ambohroh?<verse eid="1CO 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Anyi a nati a wina te ndohmoh tswanza kyangwri de ita feh sa a hunji rya? Anyi a nati a wina hafa aye inabi neh ta a rya mara agbeh reh kpeh? Anyi a nati a wina sumu londo, ŋoh neh ta a wa amwo behneh reh kpeh? <verse eid="1CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Meh bleh tsifa ata areh na kohnoh kyangwri? Amgbasho Musa reh za a tsana dehreh kpeh? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Ma a ŋa a gya nimeh amgbasho akpi reh la,&lt;&lt;Kama hama aniye ma londo hafa na ameh ata nza a buti te ndohmoh reh kpeh.&gt;&gt; A bu Londo mboh tsimoh Nnoh ka a sumu umbo? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />A bleh tsifa reh zizi ma ikpi ambohroh reh kpeh? A bu zizi, ma a ŋa tsifa ambohroh, a zohhoh kyangwri hafa tasa ata ka ava biroh awumu tama a gya agohsoh ata hunji firoh amoh anyi na awumu aye. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Nza mbohroh meh biya yohroh huru nimeh amohnoh, a nati a keh a bu gaga nza mbohroh meh kǝ fasa awumu alilehndeh nyina amohnoh reh? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Nza akyo mboh amboh anyi ma a nati a wina lisa dehreh, mbohroh reh meh keh mboh lisa dehreh kpeh?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Mbohroh neh meh sohroh gu aki ata wohroh te ndohmoh kpeh. mbohroh neh meh de kpi ahroh na awumu mboh reh nambri, la ma aki wohroh meh ti kama ha tsifa nana Kristi reh tre atsifi kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />mohnoh ni wina noh la amboh ata maka a te ndohmoh nimeh ida Nnoh reh, maka a hunji rya amoh anyi nimeh ida Nnoh reh kpeh? Tasa za amboh ata maka a te ndohmoh ma atsi yaha awumu nana agohsoh ma Nnoh ma a ka a hunji anyi ma atsi yaha awumu nyungo reh kpeh? <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />A bu dehreh za, Ada reh a bleh la amboh ata nza ma a te ndohmoh bleh tsifa nana reh mata a hunji firoh amoh anyi ma atsi bleh tsifa nana reh.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Mya neh meh hehreh gu tsifa mboh reh anyi meh ti te ndohmoh na wohroh kpeh. Mya meh ŋa ata areh ba nnoh la mohnoh ti lisa meh noh ika wohroh kpeh. A zohhoh meh ti kwo la ha akyo anyi ta a ha meh va ivoh ma agohsoh tsifa wohroh. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />A zohhoh meh ti leh va ivoh ma agohsoh tsifa la meh leh bleh tsifa nana reh kpeh. Ma a de meh na wuwana la meh ti lisa dehreh. iya agba na amya nza meh bleh mboh tsifa nana reh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Nza meh bleh tsifa reh na kira amya, meh nati hunji firoh ndohmoh amya, nza meh bleh na kira amya kpeh, a tswanza ma nga meh awumu reh la meh ti sumu. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />A bu mboh a bu firoh amya? Firoh amya a bu, te ndohmoh bleh tsifa ata nana reh, meh ti hwra tsifa reh were. Meh sohroh te ndohmoh na wuwana amya atsi bleh tsifa nana reh kpeh.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Nza mya reh meh bu wusu ma, meh kama bu ahwra akyo kpeh, meh gu ikpi amya meh ti bu ahwra kyangwri mboh nambri, la meh ti kpi kyangwri mboh gaga ba ma Kristi. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Nza a bu na Yahudawa mboh reh mya za meh gu ikpi amya tswanza Yahudawa mboh reh, meh ti kpi Yahudawa mboh. Nza a bu na amboh ata akpi nza a te ndohmoh ma ikpi amoh reh, mya za meh gu ikpi amya tswanza amboh ata akpi nza a bu ma ikpi amoh reh, mya neh akpi reh a te ndohmoh ma ikpi amya kpeh reh, la meh ti kpi amboh ata akpi nza a te ndohmoh ma ikpi amoh reh ba ma Kristi. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Na amboh ata ma a bu na akpi reh kpeh, mya za meh tswanza amboh ata ma a bu ma hohroh akpi reh kpeh, (ata areh a tsana la mya reh meh leke tufa akpi Nnoh reh kpeh, mya meh bu ma hohroh akpi kristi), la meh ti hunji amboh ata ma a bu na akpi reh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Na amboh ata nga agohsoh amoh nza a wuwana kpeh reh, mya za meh gu ikpi amya tswanza meh bu na wuwana kpeh reh, la meh ti kpi mboh ba na Kristi. Mya meh bu andromboh na kyangwri mboh reh nambri, la ma aki wohroh meh ti sa mgbiri mboh hwana. <verse eid="1CO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Meh lisa dehreh ma ikpi tsifa nana reh, la meh ti hunji firoh amya nimeh atoh a ŋoh reh.<verse eid="1CO 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Mohnoh ni wina noh la nimeh rifa, amboh gbo reh nambri maka a gbo la mata ka a handa itoh amoh, nimeh amoh neh ka a bu anyimbehreh ma a nati a hunji firoh a ŋoh? Rifa nnoh ma aki ata ni nati hunji noh firoh amohnoh. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />amboh ata maka a rifa gbo reh, maka a jiji a leh kpehkpehteh gbo reh nimeh iya. Maka a lisa dehreh la mata a hunji agamburu ata nza a nati a yanda kpeh; mbohroh neh meh lisa dehreh la meh ti hunji agamburu ata nza a nati a trina kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Nza a bu dehreh, mya meh sohroh gbo ata wusu kpeh, mlana amya za a bu inyo wusu meh leh mla kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Mya meh leh nga itoh amya iya ta a lisa andromboh ata mya nza ni kira reh tswanza ahwra nza ka a lisa ma agba a ŋoh reh. Tsifa la nza meh hwra tsifa nana reh bleh ma mgbiri, mya na ikpi amya meh ti tswa na hunji firoh reh kpeh.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Kpi Ashotoh Ma Ikpi Tufa nnoh Akǝkehreh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />ambohroh mboh, meh kira ti wina noh la, Ada ambohroh mboh reh nambri avereh tana a hama mboh, nambri ma amoh za tama gǝga nimeh fini agba atisha reh. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Nambri ma amoh ma ahwra mboh batisma nimeh avereh tasa nimeh fini agba, ahwra mboh tswanza kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a tufa Musa reh. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Ma a rya irya ata nza a bu ata huru reh nambri ma amoh, <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />tasa za ma a wa amwo ata nza a bu ata huru reh; ma a wa amwo reh anyi na kpakpa huru ata nza a leh a hehndeh a tufa mboh reh, kpakpa reh tana a bu ŋoh Kristi na ikpi a ŋoh. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Nnoh neh a sohroh a nza nana mgbiri amoh kpeh, a ka a mla mboh a kwo ma hohroh bini.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Awumu amboh areh a hunji ada ambohroh mboh reh ta a tsana reh aki, la meh ti kama lisa awumu abibi tswanza mboh tama ka a lisa reh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Kama bu noh amboh tufa Nnoh akǝkehreh tswanza mgbiri amoh mboh tama ka a tufa reh kpeh, tswanza nza ma a ŋa nimeh tsifa Nnoh reh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tama a tuma la mata a rya irya tasa za mata a wa, maka a de a hinga a leh a kira ma tohmoh nnoh akǝkehreh amoh mboh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Mbohroh za meh ti sohroh leh ahohndoh na afiya akyo ha anyifa akyo kpeh, tswanza mgbiri amoh mboh tama ka a lisa reh, nimeh ibi anyimbehreh kyangwri 23,000 ma a kwo. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Mbohroh za meh ti kama tsara Ada ambohroh nza kpeh, tswanza mgbiri mata ka a lisa reh, iyo ka a mla mboh a kwo. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Tasa za ti kama tsifa nnoh alulu tswanza mgbiri tama ka a lisa reh kpeh, Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh anyi ka a mla mboh a kwo.<verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Awumu amboh areh a hunji Ada ambohroh mboh reh ta a tsana reh aki, ma a ŋa a gya la ta akpi reh ashotoh, mbohroh amboh ata ameh trina ŋoh kǝ ba na ambohroh reh. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Nza a bu dehreh, nza ni gu ikpi anzoh la ni shi wuwana reh, lisa nza feh la ti kama hwa kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Tsara anyi kǝ hehreh hunji noh ata maka a tsara kyangwri a nza kpeh reh, Nnoh ka a bleh tsifa ta a su, a nati a kira la tsara reh ta a keh wuwana amohnoh kpeh, ma ikpi tsara reh neh ŋoh ka a gyuru nga reh aki ata meh nati hunji nvara ma atsi shi de ikpi ahroh.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Irya Ata nnoh Akǝkehreh Mboh Tasa Irya Ada Ata Nvishi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Nza a bu dehreh, ambohroh mboh ata mya nza ni kira na amohnoh reh, kama tufa nnoh nnoh akǝkehreh mboh reh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Mya meh leh tsifa na amohnoh la ni bu noh na lomo, mohnoh ti tsara ikpi amohnoh nza noh andromboh ata mya nza ni leh bleh reh. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />A bu hohndoh ata mbohroh meh kǝ kwende Nnoh na wohroh reh, a bu wohroh reh nza a de reh meh ti bu anyimbehreh nimeh imiya Kristi reh kpeh? Afohfohnoh ata mbohroh meh kǝ kya reh, a bu wohroh nza a de reh meh ti bu anyimbehreh na itoh kristi reh kpeh? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Afohfohnoh reh a bu anyimbehreh, mbohroh nza meh bu gaga itoh ambohroh za a bu anyimbehreh, nambri ma ambohroh meh rya afohfohnoh anyimbehreh.<verse eid="1CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />mohnoh nza noh kyangwri Israila mboh reh: Ha amboh ata maka a rya anyi na awumu nana agohsoh ata maka nga ma Nnoh reh, ma bu anyimbehreh na amoh mboh atsi rya awumu nana agohsoh ata nza ma nga ma Nnoh reh ma atsi nga awumu nana agohsoh reh kpeh? <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Mya reh meh gu la awumu nana agohsoh ata nza ma nga ma nnoh akǝkehreh reh a bu andromboh, ha neh nnoh akǝkehreh reh a bu andromboh? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Uwa, a bu awumu nana agohsoh amboh ata nza ma a wina Nnoh kpeh maka nga ma nnoh akǝkehreh, a bu Nnoh, meh kira ti de noh iza mohnoh ma amboh amwo mboh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />A zohhoh ti wa nnoh ma hohndoh Ada, tasa za ti gyuru wa nnoh ma hohndoh amboh amwo mboh za kpeh; ni nati wina rya irya Ada tasa rya amboh amwo mboh agba anyi kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Ha mbohroh meh kira la meh ti nga Nnoh reh gofo ta a te vene? Mbohroh reh meh keh Nnoh reh wuwana?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lisa Awumu mboh reh Nambri la Mata A nga Nnoh Agba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />&lt;&lt;Ma ata reh la meh ti lisa awumu mboh reh nambri&gt;&gt; a bu awumu mboh reh nambri neh ma a zohhoh kpeh. &lt;&lt;Ma a kira reh na awumu mboh reh nambri&gt;&gt; a bu awumu mboh reh nambri neh maka a shingi reh meh ti te agba kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Kama lisa andromboh alindeh ma ikpi anzoh tsinzo kpeh, lisa neh ta a zohhoh ma atohngoh anzoh za.<verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Rya nnoh awumu mboh reh nambri ata maka a rifa ma atsi fa wo mboh reh, nnoh kama luhu la andromboh reh a zohhoh ha a zohhoh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Tswanza nza ma a ŋa nimeh amgbasho reh la, &lt;&lt;Inziyo areh a bu Nnoh a ŋoh, tasa awumu mboh nza ma a bu nimeh reh nambri.<verse eid="1CO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Nza akyo anyi ata nza a wina Nnoh kpeh a fi noh la ti na ni rya nnoh rya ma afiya a ŋoh, nnoh ni kira ti na, rya andromboh ata nza ma a de a ba nnoh reh ti kama luhu kpeh, kohnoh agohsoh anzoh ta a kohnoh la rya reh a ka anyima kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Nza akyo neh a bleh noh la, &lt;&lt;Ma a fa iwo ata areh ma nnoh akǝkehreh mi&gt;&gt; Kama rya nnoh kpeh, tsifa kyangwri ata nza a bleh noh reh tasa kohnoh ata agohsoh anzoh. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Mya meh buti bleh kohnoh ata agohsoh a ŋoh, a bu kohnoh amohnoh kpeh. A bu lele feh kohnoh akyo a nati a ha nnoh andromboh ata nza ni kira? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Nza meh kwende Nnoh ma ikpi rya reh, a bu tsifa mboh feh ma a nati a kya meh ma ikpi rya ata mya nza ni kwere Nnoh reh?<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Ha ni rya irya, ha ni wa amwo ha ni kǝ lisa mboh, lisa awumu mboh reh nambri la mata nga noh Nnoh agba. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Kama lisa nnoh andromboh ata a nati a de akyo a hwa kpeh, ha a bu Yahudawa, ha a bu amboh ata ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh, ha kyangwri amboh tufa Nnoh mboh. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Lisa nnoh tswanza mya nza ni lisa reh, mya meh kira la kyangwri mboh mata a nza nana amya nimeh awumu ata mya nza ni leh lisa reh, a bu tsifa amya tsimya meh lisa kpeh, meh lisa la ta a shingi kyangwri mboh gaga, mata a hunji anvara.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Nza nyi nnoh na amya, tswanza mya nza ni nza nyina Kristi reh.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsana Ma Ikpi hama Ikpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Mya meh nza nana amohnoh la ni kǝ kohnoh nnoh na amya nimeh ndohmoh amohnoh mboh, tasa za la ni de noh tsana ata mya nza ni tsana noh reh yehlehleh.<verse eid="1CO 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Nehnehreh, meh kira ti wina noh la, agba kyangwri mboh reh nambri a bu Kristi, tasa za atsifa a bu agba afya ŋoh, tasa za agba Kristi reh a bu Nnoh <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Atsifa ata nza a kwere Nnoh ha ata nza a sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh ta a hama ikpi a ŋoh reh, a rina Kristi nza a bu agba a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Tasa za Afya ata nza a kwere Nnoh ha ta a sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh ta a hama ikpi a ŋoh kpeh reh, a rina atsifa nza bu agba a ŋoh reh, a zaka a tswanza a sisra shina ikpi a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Nza afya neh a hama ikpi a ŋoh kpeh, a zohhoh ta a sisra shina ikpi a ŋoh reh; nza a nati a bu na sa na afya ta a sisra ikpi a ŋoh reh, ŋoh ta a hama ikpi a ŋoh. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />A zohhoh atsifa ta a hama ikpi a ŋoh kpeh, tsifa la ŋoh reh a tswanza Nnoh tasa zohhoh Nnoh. Afya neh ta a nga atsifa a ŋoh agba. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Atsifa feh ma a kama a lisa ŋoh anyi ma itoh afya kpeh, ma a lisa afya anyi ma itoh atsifa; <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />ma a kama a lisa atsifa tsifa afya kpeh, afya neh ma a lisa ŋoh tsifa atsifa. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Ma ikpi tsifa ata areh, tasa za tsifa ata mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh, a zohhoh afya ta a hama ikpi a ŋoh, ta a tsana la atsifa a bu ma ikpi a ŋoh.<verse eid="1CO 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Dehreh za, nimeh sa Ada, afya a gafa na na atsifa a ŋoh kpeh, ha neh atsifa ta a gafa na na afya ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Tswanza afya nza a kate anyi ma itoh atsifa, dehreh za ma a mara atsifa anyi ma itoh afya. Awumu mboh reh nambri neh ma anyi na Nnoh. <verse eid="1CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />mohnoh nza noh na ikpi amohnoh: A zohhoh la afya ta a kwere Nnoh na ikpi a ŋoh wusu? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Tuma amohnoh za a tsana noh la, nza atsifa a bu na zeh shina ikpi reh, a bu andromboh sa na a ŋoh, <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />nza afya neh a bu na zeh shina ikpi, a zohhoh dehreh. Nnoh a nga ŋoh zeh shina ikpi reh la ta a hama ŋoh. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Nza akyo anyi a kira ta a kpa aniye na ata areh, meh bu na aki anyi ata meh nati tufa kpeh, a bu dehreh za na mgbiri amboh tufa mboh.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rya Ada Ata Nvishi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Ma ikpi tsifa ata areh, meh sohroh riri nnoh kpeh, dohsohna amohnoh reh a bu abibi a keh alindeh reh. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Nza anyi jiji reh, meh sere la nza ni dohsohna nnoh ma akpo anyimbehreh tswanza amboh tufa mboh reh, gafana ka a yama nimeh amohnoh, meh gu la mgbiri tsifa mboh reh ma a bu zizi shidi. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />A bu kanga la mata a hunji gafana nimeh amohnoh reh, la mata a nza kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a bu yehlehleh ma tohmoh Nnoh reh. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Nza ni dohsohna nnoh ma akpo anyimbehreh reh, a bu rya Ada ni leh rya nnoh kpeh, <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />ma atsi rya rya reh, anyi maka a dohnoh ta a rya a ŋoh, akyo ka a shi a bana atohngoh kpeh. Akyo anyi nimeh amohnoh inyo ka a de ŋoh, anyi neh ka a wa ta te ifiya. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Ni bu noh na afiya ata ni nati tuma rya ti wa nnoh nimeh reh kpeh? Ha ni rina nnoh kyangwri amboh tufa Nnoh mboh reh, ti leh nga nnoh iya ma amboh ata ma a bu na andromboh kpeh? Nehnehreh meh nati bleh noh la umbo? Ha meh ti krumusu nnoh tsifa ata areh? Wa, meh nati krumusu nnoh kpeh.<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Andromboh ata mya nza ni nga nnoh reh, meh sa nyi na Ada: la Ada Yeso, ma shini ata ma a nati a de ŋoh a nga mboh reh, tana a gu afohfohnoh, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />ŋoh nza ka a kwende ma Nnoh ka a treh reh, a ka a kya afohfohnoh reh ta ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ata areh a bu itoh amya, nza ma a de ba tsifa amohnoh reh; lisa nnoh ti kǝ kohnoh nnoh na amya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Ma aki wohroh za, nza ma a rya ka a treh neh ka a gyuru a gu hohndoh wa amwo za ta ka a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Hohndoh wa amwo ata areh a bu tsifa bleh gya afeh ŋoh nimeh imiya amya; lisa nnoh dehreh, ameh ata ni wa nnoh reh, ti kǝ kohnoh na amya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Ameh ata ni rya nnoh afohfohnoh reh, ti wa nnoh nimeh hohndoh reh za, ni buti tsana noh la Ada reh a kwo tsifa ambohroh, ni nati kǝ lisa nnoh dehreh gu na ibi ata ŋoh nza a nati a gyuru a ba reh.<verse eid="1CO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Nza a bu dehreh, akyo ata nza a rya afohfohnoh tasa ta a wa imiya nimeh hohndoh Ada reh ma aki ata nza a zohhoh kpeh reh, a kpakpana ma itoh Nnoh tasa mya a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />A zohhoh kyangwri ta a tsara ikpi a ŋoh a nza feh sa a rya afohfohnoh tasa ta a wa nimeh hohndoh reh. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Akyo ata nza a rya tasa za ta a wa nimeh hohndoh reh ta a nga agba ma itoh Ada kpeh reh, akyo wohroh a fi hwra akpi ma ikpi a ŋoh ma aki rya tasa wa reh. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />A bu tsifa wohroh vara amohnoh ni bu noh na wuwana kpeh reh tasa na bishi, tasa mgbiri amohnoh mboh za maa a kwo. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Nza mbohroh neh meh tsara ikpi ambohroh nza, ma a nati ahwra reh akpi kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Nza a bu Nnoh ahwra reh akpi reh, a nati a nga reh iya la meh ti kama lofona Mbohroh ma amboh inziyo mboh reh kpeh.<verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Nza a bu dehreh, ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh, nza ni ba nnoh ma akpo anyimbehreh atsi rya rya Ada reh, ti bana nnoh amohnoh mboh. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Nza inyo a keh akyo anyi nimeh amohnoh, ta a rya rya ma afya a ŋoh, la dohsohna amohnoh ta a kama a de hwra akpi a ba nnoh kpeh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 11:34">Nza meh nati gyuru ba fya meh ti tsana noh mgbiri awumu mboh reh.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ngǝnga Ata Huru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />nehnehreh, ambohroh mboh, ma ikpi ngǝnga ata huru zanana reh, meh kira la meh ti ta nnoh nimeh shini kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Ni wina noh la na ameh ata ti kǝ bu noh amboh tufa Nnoh kpeh reh, tama a landa nnoh, ni gyuru tufa nnoh nnoh akǝkehreh amboh ata nza ma a bu na fene kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Nza a bu dehreh, mya meh bleh noh la, a bu akyo ata nza ka atsifa na huru a nati a wina bleh la,&lt;&lt; Yeso a bu abibi kpeh,&gt;&gt;tasa akyo anyi a nati a wina bleh la,&lt;&lt;Yeso a bu Ada,&gt;&gt; a bu akyo ata huru zanana nza a bu na a ŋoh.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Ngǝnga mboh reh ma a yama ma atsetse, huru neh a bu anyimbehreh. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Akeki a yama ma atsetse ata tufa Nnoh reh, Ada neh a bu anyimbehreh. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Ndohmoh a yama ma angǝshi, A bu Nnoh anyimbehreh wohroh neh ka nga reh wuwana te ndohmoh mboh reh nambri.<verse eid="1CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Nnoh ka nga kyangwri mboh reh anyinyi huru ata zanana reh, la ta a shingi reh nambri. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Anyi za ma nga ŋoh ngǝnga ata tsana tasa ata lomo ma aki huru, anyi za ma nga ŋoh ngǝnga ata lomo tasa ata wina ata nza anyi Ma huru ata areh. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Anyi za ma a lisa ŋoh na nga agohsoh ata huru, anyi za ma nga ŋoh ngǝnga ata nga kyangwri amboh bishi mboh wuwana anyi Ma huru, <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />anyi za ngǝnga ata ndohmoh ŋara aniye, anyi za a bu ata sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh, anyi za a bu ata nza huru mboh a wina, anyi a bu ata wina tsifa na arimi atsetse, anyi za a bu ata sehreh arimi atsetse a wina ta a bleh. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Awumu amboh areh na nambri ma a te ndohmoh anyimbehreh tasa huru anyimbehreh, tasa za nga mboh ma atsetse, na kira a ŋoh.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Itoh anyimbehreh, Avohvoh Vara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Tswanza itoh a bu anyimbehreh a bu na avohvoh itoh gaga; avohvoh itoh mboh nza ma a bu gaga reh, itoh reh a bu anyimbehreh. A ka bu dehreh nimeh isa Kristi. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Ma a wra reh batisma na huru anyimbehreh nimeh itoh anyimbehreh, ha ni bu Yahudawa, ha amboh ata ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh, ahwra ha amboh ata ma bu ahwra kpeh, a tswanza ma nga reh huru anyimbehreh wohroh timi wa.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />nehnehreh itoh a bu na avohvoh anyimbehreh kpeh, avohvoh itoh reh a bu vara. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Nza ambasa hwana ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt; Tsifa la mya meh bu ivoh kpeh, mya meh bu ata itoh kpeh,&gt;&gt; a nati a bu ma ikpi tsifa wohroh ta a bleh la ŋoh bu ata itoh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Tasa za nza ashotoh ka a bleh la,&lt;&lt; Tsifa la mya meh bu iyo kpeh, mya meh bu ata itoh kpeh,&gt;&gt;a nati a bu ma ikpi tsifa wohroh ta a bleh la ŋoh bu ata itoh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Nza itoh na agba ma reh a bu iyo, atsi sehreh tsifa reh a nati bu mma? Nza itoh reh na agba ma a bu ashotoh, atsi sehreh angǝshi reh bu mma? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Nnoh neh kǝ lisa avohvoh itoh mboh reh gya, tswanza ŋoh nza a kira ta a bu dehreh <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Ma a bleh la itoh reh a bu avohvoh anyimbehreh, mgbiri itoh reh a nati a bu ma mma? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Tswanza nza a bu dehreh reh, avohvoh itoh a yama gaga, itoh neh a bu anyimbehreh.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />iyo a nati a wina a bleh ma ivoh la,&lt;&lt;Meh kira nnoh kpeh!&gt;&gt; Tasa ikpi za a nati a wina bleh ma hwana la,&lt;&lt;Meh kira nnoh kpeh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />A bu dehreh kpeh, avohvoh itoh amboh ata nza ma a nza la ma a wuwana kpeh, a bu amboh wohroh maka nga mboh agba a keh, <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />tasa za avohvoh itoh amboh ata nza ma a nza la ma anyinana reh, meh kǝ nga mboh agba keh mgbiri. Ma aki wohroh avohvoh itoh amboh ata nza ma a zohhoh nza kpeh reh, maka a mishi mboh zohhoh. <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />Avohvoh itoh ambohroh mboh nza ma a zohhoh nza reh, ma a nati a lisa mboh andromboh za kpeh, Nnoh neh kǝ dohdohsoh avohvoh itoh mboh reh ma itoh anyimbehreh, nga agba ma avohvoh itoh ata nza ma nga ŋoh agba shidi ma reh. <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />la gafana ta a kama a yama nimeh itoh kpeh reh, neh la avohvoh itoh mboh reh mata a shingi itoh amoh. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Nza avohvoh itoh anyi a nza iya, itoh na agba ma a nati a nza iya; nza ma krumusu avohvoh anyimbehreh, mgbiri avohvoh mboh reh za maka a johjoh na a ŋoh.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />nehnehreh ni bu noh tswanza itoh Kristi, nambri ma amohnoh ni bu noh itoh a ŋoh. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Tasa za nimeh ida Nnoh reh, Nnoh a jiji a seh amboh ble tsifa nana mboh reh mata a bu ata jiji ŋoh, ata afri a bu amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh mboh, ata atatoh a bu amboh tsana mboh, a treh feh sa ka a seh amboh ndohmoh ŋara aniye mboh, tasa amboh ata nza ma a bu na ngǝnga ata nga kyangwri mboh wuwana, tasa amboh ata maka a shingi mgbiri mboh, tasa amboh ata nza ma a wina de kyangwri, tasa amboh ata ma a wina tsifa arimi mgbiri kyangwri. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Ni bu noh amboh ble tsifa nana mboh reh nambri? Ni bu noh amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh mboh reh nambri? Ni bu noh amboh tsana mboh reh nambri? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />A bu nambri ma amoh ma a bu na ngǝnga ata nga kyangwri mboh wuwana? A bu nambri ma amoh maka a wina sehreh arimi anyi a bleh? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />mohnoh fa ti hunji noh ngǝnga ata nza a keh mgbiri mboh reh agba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">nehnehreh meh a nati tsana noh aki ata nza a keh mgbiri zohhoh reh.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Kira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Nza meh wina tsifa na arimi mboh gaga ata kyangwri mboh nza maka tsifa na wohroh tasa mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh, neh meh ti sohroh bu na kira kpeh, meh zakǝ bu tswanza ma tsinga mgbimgbi zohhoh tasa kanga ma. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Nza meh wina sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh, tasa za meh wina lomo Nnoh ata huho ŋoh tasa lomo mboh reh nambri, tasa meh ti bu na nga agohsoh ata nza a wina yiyi agbohgboh mboh kpusu, neh meh ti bu na kira na kyangwri mboh kpeh meh sohroh bu andromboh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Nza meh nga awumu amya ma amboh iya mboh. Tasa meh ti nga itoh amya la mata afya meh a kwo, neh meh ti bu na kira na kyangwri mboh kpeh, meh sohroh hunji andromboh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />amboh ata nza ma a kira na mgbiri kyangwri mboh maka a lisa mboh na soh ivoh yira tasa za maka a lisa mboh alindeh. amboh ata nza ma a bu na kira ata a zizi ŋoh maka a sohroh a te vene na amoh kpeh, maka a sohroh a gu ikpi a ka ha mata a rya itoh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />amboh ata nza ma a bu na kira ata a zizi ŋoh ma kyangwri mboh maka a sohroh a rina mboh kpeh. Maka a sohroh a tsana kira ikpi kpeh. Maka a sohroh a te gofo na gbugbo kpeh. Maka a sohroh a de kyangwri mboh ma agohsoh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />amboh ata nza ma a bu na kira ata a zizi ŋoh maka a sohroh a nza nana lisa awumu abibi kpeh neh maka a nza na na na tsifa a zizi. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />amboh ata nza ma a bu na kira ata a zizi ŋoh maka a soh ivoh yira na awumu mboh gaga. Maka a bu na nga agohsoh, maka a de ikpi ahroh a wuwa nimeh iya. <verse eid="1CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Kira ka a trina kpeh a gu a na tuma atono. Nga ata sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh a nati a trina. Nga ata tsifa na arimi mboh gaga a nati a trina ibi anyi. Nga ata wina lomo a nati a trina. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Nnoh a sohroh a vuru reh awumu mboh reh nambri kpeh, dehreh za meh nati sohroh wina awumu mboh ata ŋoh nza a wina reh nambri kpeh, <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />ameh a nati a ba neh awumu mboh reh nambri ma a nati a su. Ata nza a su kpeh reh a nati a trina. <verse eid="1CO 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Meh ti kǝ bu amehreh akehreh, meh kǝ tsifa ikata amehreh mboh nza maka atsifa reh, meh kǝ kohnoh tswanza amehreh mboh. Nza meh kǝ te kyangwri agba neh, meh kǝ yi aki amehreh mboh reh ta. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Nehnehreh meh tre nza yafa firifiri atsi gǝga ma amwo ka a fi shini, nza timi na inza neh meh nati nza kakende. Nehnehreh meh wina shidi ma, na ameh wohroh meh nati wina nambri, tswanza Nnoh nza a nza reh a wina nambri reh. <verse eid="1CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Nehnehreh awumu atatoh amboh areh ma a yama: Nga agohsoh, gya agohsoh tasa kira. Neh ata nza a bu agbagbaa a bu kira.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s">Ngǝnga Ata Sa Tohmoh Nnoh A bleh Tasa Tsifa Na Arimi Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Ni nati kǝ kira nnoh mgbiri kyangwri mboh kanga. Tasa, ti kǝ kira sa noh huru zanana ata nza anyi na Nnoh. Tasa za ti kǝ keh kira nnoh huru sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Kyangwri ata nza atsifa na arimi mboh atsetse reh a sohroh atsifa na kyangwri mboh kpeh, atsifa na Nnoh mi, maka atsifa andromboh ata mgbiri kyangwri mboh nza ma a sohroh a wina kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Kyangwri ata nza a sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh neh, a ka atsifa na kyangwri mboh la ta a shingi mboh, ta a nga mboh wuwa agohsoh tasa soh ivoh yira. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />amboh ata nza ma tsifa na arimi amboh tswa ma a te ma ikpi amoh atoh, amboh ata nza ma a sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh neh ma a te atoh ma kyangwri amboh tufa nambri tsifa ata nza ma atsifa na arimi ata kyangwri mboh nza ma a sehreh a wina reh. <verse eid="1CO 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Meh nati kira ti tsifa nnoh na arimi amboh ata nza ni sohroh wina noh kpeh dehreh neh, meh keh kira te sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh noh; ata nza a sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh a keh ata nza atsifa na arimi mboh, nza akyo sa bleh ŋoh a yama ta a sa a bleh feh. <verse eid="1CO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />ambohroh mboh amboh tufa, nza meh ba na amohnoh meh ti tsifa na arimi amboh anyi tse ata mohnoh nza ni sohroh sehreh noh kpeh. Nza meh bleh andromboh ata Nnoh nza a vuru meh reh kpeh, ha meh ti bleh noh tsifa ata nza anyi na Nnoh welele, ha meh ti bleh noh andromboh ata nza a zohhoh ti wina noh, wohroh reh ka a nati a shingi nnoh lele? <verse eid="1CO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />A zaka a tswanza kyangwri mboh nza maka a wri afifi ha mata mini ngongo reh. Awumu amboh wohroh ma a sohroh a bu na fene kpeh. Nza meh sohroh wina wri ŋoh ha meh ti wina mini ŋoh kpeh, neh anyi a nati a sehreh a wina? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Tasa za, amboh na gofo maka a sehreh Behbleh na gofo a wina feh masa a na gofo kpeh? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />A bu dehreh na amohnoh za. Nza ni sohroh tsifa nnoh kyangwri mboh mata sere a wina kpeh, akyo anyimbehreh a nati a sohroh a sehreh a wina kpeh. A nati a bu tswanza ni zakǝ leh tsifa sangra nnoh ma inyo ma. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Ma atsifa arimi mboh atsetse ma inziyo areh. Tasa amboh tsifa arimi mboh reh maka a sehreh a wina. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Nza meh sohroh sere tsifa amoh wina kpeh neh, amboh wohroh ma a bu achifi mboh na ambohroh. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />A bu dehreh na amohnoh za amboh ata nza ni kira ti hunji noh ngǝnga ata huru, fa ti hunji noh ngǝnga ata nza ka a shingi kyangwri amboh tufa mboh reh.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Nza a bu dehreh, nza ni tsifa na arimi mboh atsetse, kwere Nnoh la huru ta a shingi nnoh sa lomo tsifa reh a bleh. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Nza meh kwere Nnoh na arimi anyi tse, a bu huru amya ma tsene a kwere. Neh meh sohroh gu agohsoh amya kwere ika wohroh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Nza a bu dehreh meh nati lisa lele? Meh nati kwere Nnoh nimeh huru, neh meh nati kwere Nnoh na agohsoh amya za; Meh nati kpa amumu na huru amya, neh meh nati kpa amumu na agohsoh amya za. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Nza akyo amohnoh anyi ka a kwende Nnoh nimeh huru, kyangwri wusu ŋoh nimeh amohnoh ka a nati a lisa lele feh sa ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Avoh dehreh&gt;&gt; na kwende anzoh reh, ŋoh nza a sohroh a wina ha ni kǝ bleh la mboh kpeh reh? <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Kwende anzoh reh a bu kwende alindeh nimeh huru dehreh neh. Tsifa anzoh reh a sohroh a shingi mgbiri amboh tufa ta a nga mboh wuwana kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Meh kwende Nnoh la meh wina tsifa na arimi atsetse keh nnoh nambri. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Nza amboh tufa ma dohsohna neh; meh kǝ keh kira meh ti bleh mboh tsifa atungu na kohnoh amya, la meh ti bleh tsana mgbiri amboh tufa mboh, na ata meh ti bleh tsifa dubu agrumavoh arimi anyi tse.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />ambohroh amboh tufa mboh, kama kohnoh nnoh tswanza amehreh akǝkehreh mboh kpeh. Nza a bu ma atsi lisa agugu feh ti bu noh amehreh akǝkehreh mboh, kohnoh amohnoh neh ta bu ata agbugba kyangwri mboh. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />A bu ŋa gya ma amgbasho akpi la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">&lt;&lt;Meh nati tsifa na kyangwri amboh areh na arimi anyi tse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">tasa ma aniye achifi mboh</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">Meh nati tsifa na Kyangwri amboh areh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">za neh ma a nati a kya ashotoh na tsifa amya reh kpeh,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="1CO 14:21">Ada reh a bleh dehreh.<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Nza a bu dehreh, ngǝnga ata tsifa na arimi mboh atsetse a bu tswanza kpra na amboh tufa mboh kpeh, a bu kpra neh na amboh ata nza ma a wina Nnoh kpeh; sa tohmoh bleh reh a bu ata amboh tufa mboh, a bu ata amboh ata nza ma nza ma a wina Nnoh kpeh reh. <verse eid="1CO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Nza a bu dehreh, nza amboh tufa mboh maka dohsohna ma akpo anyimbehreh tasa za maka atsifa na arimi mboh atsetse, nza amboh ata nza ma a sohroh a sehreh arimi wohroh kpeh ha amboh ata nza ma a wina Nnoh kpeh maka aniye a ba maka sere tsifa mboh reh atsetse, ma a nati a nza amoh la ni te nnoh a kwere. <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Nza akyo ata nza a sohroh a wina Nnoh kpeh reh ha a sehreh arimi amboh wohroh a wina kpeh reh neh ka a ba na amohnoh atsi sa tohmoh Nnoh reh, tsifa amohnoh reh nambri a nati a tsana ŋoh la ŋoh a bu kyangwri kpakpana tasa za ŋoh a nati a gyuruna ata aki agugu a ŋoh reh kpeh, <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />agugu sene wohroh reh ka a nati a kate: Ka a nati a dohnoh ma inzi tasa ta ka ariri Nnoh. A nati a bleh la, &lt;Zizi Nnoh a yama nimeh amohnoh na ma areh!&gt;<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Krumusu Alindeh Ma Ida Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Atsi amya amboh tufa mboh, nza ni dohsohna nnoh lisa nnoh dehreh. Nza nimeh amohnoh anyi a bu na amumu riri Nnoh, amboh anyi ma a bu na lomo tsana ma ikpi Nnoh. amboh anyi ma a bu na andromboh anyi ata Nnoh nza a tsana mboh. Anyi a bu na tsifa na arimi anyi tse. Anyi ma a bu amboh sa lomo tsifa reh a bleh. Lisa nnoh amboh areh nambri ma aki ata nza a nati a de rya tohmoh a ba ma amboh tufa mboh reh nambri. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Nza akyo mboh ma a nati atsifa na arimi anyi tse, ma a kama a keh kyangwri afri ha atatoh kpeh, mata kama tsifa ma hwana anyimbehreh kpeh, anyi ta atsifa neh anyi ta ka a gyuru a sa lomo tsifa reh a bleh kanga. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Nza akyo ata nza a nati a sa lomo tsifa reh a bleh a sohroh a yama kpeh, akyo wohroh ta a bu gbalala ma dohsohna duma mboh reh ta atsifa ma ikpi ŋoh tasa Nnoh.<verse eid="1CO 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Nza ni dohsohna nnoh, amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh mboh afri mata a bleh tsifa ata nza ma a sehreh anyi na Nnoh neh, amboh tswa mata a sehreh tsifa reh a chehcheh a nza andromboh ata nza ma a bleh reh. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Nza tsifa afeh anyi a gyuru anyi na Nnoh a ba na amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh anyi nza a tuma ma inzi reh, ata nza a bu nimeh tsifa reh ta a bu gbalala fya. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Ni nati wina tsifa nnoh tsifa ata nza anyi na Nnoh reh nambri ma amohnoh anyinyimbehreh, ti hunji noh tsana tasa wuwa itoh. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh ma a nati a wina fla huru amoh ta a te ve a bana anyi ta atsifa a treh feh. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Nnoh a sohroh a bu Nnoh ata kputuna kpeh, a kira la nza ni dohsohna nnoh, tuma noh alindeh, a bu dehreh za ma atsi dohsohna amboh tufa mboh nambri. <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />Fya mboh ma a bu gbalala ma atsi dohsohna amboh tufa mboh. Mata kama tsifa kpeh, mata a wina la mboh ma a bu amboh tufa tsifa amoh mboh amgbasho akpi za a bleh dehreh. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Nza ma a kira mata a wina andromboh anyi, mata luhu tsifa amoh mboh ma afiya, a nati a te na isa afiya ta atsifa nimeh dohsohna amboh tufa mboh. <verse eid="1CO 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Wina nnoh la tsifa Nnoh reh a sohroh a jiji a ba na amohnoh ma korintiya kpeh, tasa za la a sohroh a bu mohnoh ŋa ni tre sere nnoh tsifa ata areh kpeh, kyangwri mboh gaga ma a sehreh tsifa reh a sa a kira. <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Nza akyo anyi amohnoh a kohnoh la ŋoh a bu kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh, ha la ŋoh kǝ sa ngǝnga anyi ata huru anyi na Nnoh. Ta a wina la tsifa ata mya nza ni ŋa reh anyi na Nnoh mi. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Nza ma a leke tsifa amya, mohnoh amboh tufa mboh ti kama sa mboh nnoh kpeh za. <verse eid="1CO 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Atsi mya amboh tufa, bleh noh tsifa ata nza anyi na Nnoh reh welele, tasa za ti kama ha nnoh amboh tsifa na arimi mboh atsetse reh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Lisa nnoh awumu mboh nambri nimeh ida Nnoh ma aki ata nza a bu yehlehleh .<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s">Yeso A kwo A gyuru A hinga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Nehnehreh, ambohroh amboh tufa, meh kira meh ti kohnoh nnoh ma ikpi tsifa ma ikpi kristi ata mya ti kǝ bleh noh reh. A bu tsifa ata mohnoh nza ni sa nnoh tasa ti nga nnoh agohsoh amohnoh gaga reh. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Nza ni rya nnoh tohmoh ni nga agohsoh amohnoh gaga ma ikpi tsifa mya ti kǝ hwra bleh noh reh, mohnoh ni nati nvara nnoh. Nza ni sohroh rya nnoh tomo na nga agohsoh ma ikpi ŋoh kpeh, nga agohsoh amohnoh ma ikpi kristi reh a bu were ma. <verse eid="1CO 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Mya meh sa tsifa nana nyi na Kristi Yeso, tasa za meh bleh noh tsifa wohroh. Meh bleh noh la: Kristi a kwo ta a gu vari kpakpana ambohroh, tswanza amgbasho Nnoh mboh mata ka a bleh a gya reh. <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />Kyangwri mboh maka anyifo kohmoh a ŋoh. ibi na atatoh ŋoh neh, Nnoh ka a de ŋoh a te na fene yama, tswanza nza ma a ŋa gya ma amgbasho mboh la a nati a lisa reh. <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />Na wohroh Abitrusu ka nza Kristi tasa mgbiri amboh sa tohmoh nana Yeso bleh mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Tasa za ka a kate ma kyangwri amboh tufa deri atungu na ameh wohroh. Mgba keh mboh deri atungu reh ma a treh a yama na fene, amboh tswa neh ma a kwo. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Neh Kristi ka a kate ma Yakubu tasa za ka a kate ma amboh tufa mboh nambri. <verse eid="1CO 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Ma trina ŋoh, Kristi ka a kate meh mya za, ata nza meh bu kyangwri tufa Yeso nza ma a fi meh anyi ma aki anyi tse. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Ma a zizi, mya meh bu akehreh nimeh amboh tufa. Meh sohroh tswa meh ti bu kyangwri tufa Yeso kpeh, mya meh de amboh tufa Yeso te iya. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Nnoh neh ka a tsana meh kira gaga, ma aki ata nza meh sohroh tswa meh ti bu andrehmeh areh kpeh. Kira ata Nnoh nza a tsana meh reh ka a de rya tohmoh a ba gaga, tsifa wohroh mya kǝ te ndohmoh keh mgbiri amboh tufa nambri. Neh a sohroh a bu mya nza meh te ndohmoh reh kpeh a bu Nnoh mi a nga meh kira gaga. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />A bu tsifa wohroh reh ŋa mohnoh nza ni sa kira nnoh reh. A sohroh a bu la a bu anyi ŋa a bleh noh tsifa reh kpeh, ha a bu mya meh bleh noh ha a bu atohngoh amya anyi, kyangwri mboh ma a nati a gyuru a hinga.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gyuru Hinga amboh Nza ma Kwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Mbohroh meh bleh noh tsifa la: Nnoh a yiri Kristi anyi ma ikpi nyifo . Neh amboh tswa amohnoh ma a bleh la amboh nza ma a kwo ma a nati a sohroh a gyuru a hinga za kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Akyo ata nza a bleh dehreh a sohroh a bleh yehlehleh kpeh. Nza amboh ata nza ma a sohroh a nati a gyuru a hinga kpeh, neh Yeso za a sohroh a gyuru a hinga anyi ma ikpi nyifo kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />Tasa za nza Nnoh a sohroh a yiri Kristi a hinga kpeh, neh tsifa ata nza Mbohroh nza meh hwra bleh noh reh ka a bu were ma, nga agohsoh amohnoh reh za ka a bu were ma. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Nza tsifa hinga a nati a sohroh a yama kpeh, wohroh Mbohroh meh huru nnoh tsifa la Nnoh a yiri Kristi ta ka a kwo reh anyi ma ikpi nyifo . Neh nza amboh kwo mboh ma a sohroh a gyuru a hinga kpeh, wohroh reh ka a nati a sohroh a bu zizi kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Nza a bu dehreh, nza kunu kyangwri mboh ma a sohroh a hinga a fene afeh kpeh, neh Kristi za a sohroh a hinga ta ka a jiji a kwo reh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Nza a bu zizi la Nnoh a sohroh a yiri Kristi ta a gyuru a bu na fene ŋoh ta ka a jiji a kwo reh kpeh, nga agohsoh amohnoh na Yeso reh a bu were; Ni tre nnoh nimeh kpakpana amohnoh. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Neh amboh ata nza ma a kwo ma aki nga agohsoh amoh na Kristi reh ma a nati a bleh a kasa. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Mbohroh amboh tufa mboh, mbohroh meh nga agohsoh ambohroh na Yeso la a nati nga reh fene. Nza mbohroh meh gya agohsoh ambohroh were, kyangwri mboh mata nza kwini ambohroh a keh mgbiri kyangwri mboh nambri. <verse eid="1CO 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />A bu tsifa a zizi la Yeso tana a kwo neh Nnoh ka a gyuru a yiri ŋoh la ta a gyuru a na na a ŋoh ma Inza. Ŋoh a bu ata anyimbehreh ŋoh nza a kwo, Mbohroh meh wina la amboh ata nza ma a kwo ma a nati a gyuru a hinga yama. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Kyangwri mboh nambri ma a kwo ma ikpi tsifa vari agugu ata kyangwri anyimbehreh nza a lisa. Ŋoh a bu Adamu. Tasa za a bu tsifa kyangwri anyimbehreh za duma mboh ma a nati a hinga anyi ma kwo, wohroh a bu Kristi. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />A bu tsifa Adamu, kyangwri nambri ma a kwo, dehreh za kyangwri nambri ma a nati a hunji fene anyi na Yeso. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Mbohroh za meh nati kwo kanga. Nnoh a jiji a yiri Kristi. Tasa nza Kristi a gyuru a ba, Nnoh a nati a gyuru a yiri amboh ata nza ma a bu ata Kristi a ŋoh mata a hinga yama. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Neh trina ŋoh ka a nati a ba, Kristi ka a nati a nga kpra Agohmoh ma Ada Nnoh, na wohroh ŋoh kǝ druhu wuwana agohgohmoh mboh nambri. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Kristi na ikpi a ŋoh ka a nati a te Agohmoh ma inziyo, tana a keh wuwana amboh ata nza ma a nza ŋoh kpeh ma iyo reh nambri. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Agugu ata nza a nati a keh wuwana a ŋoh ma trina ŋoh reh a bu kwo. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Ma bleh nimeh amgbasho Zabura la Nnoh a nati a nga awumu mboh ta a bu ma ivoh Kristi nambri. Neh, &lt;Nambri&gt; reh a sohroh a mangara na Nnoh nimeh kpeh, la a bu Nnoh a nati a nga Kristi wuwana de awumu mboh reh nambri. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Nza awumu mboh nambri tana a bu ma wuwana Amehreh Nnoh, neh Kristi ka a nati a gu ikpi a ŋoh a fi nimeh wuwana Nnoh, ata nza a nga ŋoh wuwana wohroh. Neh Nnoh a nati ka a de awumu mboh nambri a treh atsifi. <verse eid="1CO 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Nza gyuru hinga amboh kwo mboh a nati a yama kpeh, ŋoh amboh ata nza ma a wra mboh batisma ma amboh kwo mboh reh neh? nza ma a yiri amboh kwo mboh kpeh, maka a wra ma kyangwri mboh batisma la tsifa amoh reh lele? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Tasa za, kohnoh nza Mbohroh amboh sa tohmoh Yeso bleh! na tutu maka a fa reh la mata mla reh kwo. <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />ambohroh mboh amboh tufa, ibibi maka fa meh la mata mla meh a kwo! A bu zizi la mya meh nza nana mohnoh nza ni bu noh amboh kira na Kristi Yeso Ada ambohroh. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Nza meh mla na na agbugba wo aye mboh ma Afisa, nza Nnoh a nati a sohroh a yiri amboh nza ma a kwo kpeh, a firoh amya ka a bu umbo? &lt;Nza a bu dehreh mbohroh meh nati rya meh ti wa ma, mbohroh meh nati kwo ikya yama?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Kama kira nnoh amboh ata nza ma a bleh la Nnoh a nati a sohroh a yiri amboh ata nza ma a kwo ma aki tufa kpeh yehlehleh reh, &lt;&lt;Nza ni de iza na amboh agugu amboh ata nza ma a ka bleh dehreh reh, ma a nati a de lomo amohnoh a te abibi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Gyuru kohnoh nnoh alindeh yama, ta nnoh aki agugu; amboh tswa amohnoh ma a sohroh a wina Nnoh kpeh, tsifa wohroh maka a kohnoh abibi. Meh bleh dehreh la ta a te nnoh na isa.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sene Itoh Ata Hinga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />amboh anyi nimeh amohnoh ma a luhu la, &lt;&lt;Ma a nati a lisa lele feh amboh ata nza ma a kwo mata a gyuru a hinga? Maka a nati a bu na itoh ika atamaa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Akyo ata nza a luhu ika ata wohroh a bu duduna! Biroh a ka a sehnehna feh sa a te mbeh. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Nza ni biya biroh, ha a bu biroh akroh ha yashi, a sohroh a bu wohroh reh yehlehleh a nati a te mbeh kpeh, a bu mini ŋoh mi. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Nnoh a ka nga awumu mboh nambri itoh atsetse. A nga yohroh awumu mboh itoh atsetse. <verse eid="1CO 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Wo itoh mboh ma a bu atsetse, kyangwri mboh amoh tse, wo aye amoh tse, kpo tasa akuku mboh za amoh atsetse. <verse eid="1CO 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Tasa za, Nnoh a lisa awumu amboh anyi ma Inza tasa amboh anyi ma Inzi, awumu amboh Inza ma a zohhoh amoh tse, tasa kyangwri mboh ma Inziyo ma a zohhoh amoh tse. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />nnoh a zana a ŋoh tse, tasa Nara a zana a ŋoh tse, akpukpa mboh za ma a zana atsetse, anyi a zana a keh atohngoh. <verse eid="1CO 15:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />A bu dehreh za na itoh ambohroh mboh, itoh ata meh nati bu na wohroh nza Nnoh tana a gyuru a yiri reh anyi ma kwo reh a nati a sohroh a bu tswanza itoh ambohroh ata Inziyo reh kpeh. Itoh ambohroh ata nza meh bu na wohroh nehnehreh a nati a kwo a hwina, itoh afeh ata ma a nati a nga reh a nati a kwo kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Maka anyifo itoh nimeh kwini, maka a yiri itoh nimeh nga agba. itoh ambohroh ata nehnehreh a sohroh a wuwana kpeh neh, itoh ambohroh afeh ŋoh reh a nati a wuwana. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Maka anyifo itoh ambohroh ata inziyo, mata a gyuru a yiri nimeh huru.</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="1CO 15:44">Itoh ambohroh ata Mbohroh meh jiji bu na wohroh a bu itoh ata inziyo, itoh ambohroh afeh ŋoh neh a nati a bu itoh ata huru Nnoh nza a ka a tsana ŋoh aki.</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="1CO 15:44">Tswanza itoh ata inziyo nza a yama, itoh ata huru Nnoh nza a tsana ŋoh aki za a yama. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Ma a ŋa ma amgbasho tsifa Nnoh la, &lt;&lt;Nza ma a lisa kyangwri ata jiji ŋoh, Adamu&gt;&gt; kristi za ka a ba ba a te kyangwri. Neh ŋoh a bu tse na adamu reh, la ŋoh a bu kyangwri nga reh fene. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Itoh ambohroh ata jiji ŋoh reh neh a bu ata akehkehndeh, itoh ata huru Nnoh nza a nga reh reh a ba nyina. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Nnoh a lisa kyangwri ata jiji ŋoh Adamu reh anyi ma avru ata inzi. Kristi neh, ata nza a ba nyina reh, a ba anyi inza. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Kyangwri mboh ma inziyo ma a bu na itoh tswanza kyangwri ata jiji ŋoh Adamu ta ka a bu na wohroh reh; Ma inza kyangwri mboh nambri ma a nati a bu na itoh tswanza kristi. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Tasa tswanza Nnoh nza a nga reh itoh tswanza kyangwri ata jiji ŋoh Adamu nza a bu na wohroh reh, dehreh za Mbohroh amboh nga agohsoh mboh meh nati bu na itoh tswanza kristi a ŋoh. Ata nza a bu ma inza nehnehreh. <verse eid="1CO 15:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />ambohroh amboh nga agohsoh mboh, meh kira ti wina noh la Mbohroh meh nati sohroh wina nna inza, atsi ata Nnoh nza a bu Agohmoh ma ikpi awumu nambri na itoh ambohroh ata inziyo areh kpeh, la itoh ambohroh a nati a sohroh a tuma atono kpeh. A nati a kwo ta a hwina. <verse eid="1CO 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Neh meh nati bleh noh andromboh ata Nnoh kǝ hehreh vuru tsana akyo nza kpeh: ambohroh amboh tufa amboh tswa ma a nati a sohroh a kwo kpeh. Dehreh neh, Nnoh a nati a sehneh reh nambri ma ambohroh <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />a nati a bu ma hwana anyimbehreh, tswanza kya iyo, nza meh sere wri drumu Nnoh ata trina ŋoh. Nza meh sere wri drumu wohroh, amboh nga agohsoh amboh ata nza ma a kwo ma a nati a gyuru a hinga na fene tasa ma a nati a hunji itoh ata nza ma a sehneh, itoh ata nza a nati a sohroh a hwina kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Tasa itoh ambohroh amboh ata nza meh bu na fene ma a nati a sehneh za. Ma a nati a sehneh itoh ambohroh ata nza a ka a kwo ta a hwina reh a te afeh ata nza a nati a kwo kpeh kanga; a nati a bu tswanza kyangwri ata nza a sehneh kuri a ŋoh atono ta a gyuru a were afeh ŋoh. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Nza tana a bu dehreh, tsifa na amgbasho Ishaya reh ka a nati a su la,&lt;&lt;Nnoh a nati a gu kwo a hinga. Kwo ambohroh a nati a za a keh wuwana ambohroh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />Kwo a nati a za a keh wuwana ambohroh kpeh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:55">kwo a nati a za a bu na toso ma ikpi ambohroh kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 15:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Mbohroh meh kwo vari kpakpana ambohroh, tasa a bu tsifa la Mbohroh meh bu na amgbasho akpi Nnoh ŋa meh wina la Mbohroh meh kpakpana. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Mbohroh neh meh kwende Nnoh! la Yeso a ba ba a sa reh a hwana anyi ma aki tufa akpi feh misi hunji nvara tasa za la meh ti kama nyiri kwo za kpeh. <verse eid="1CO 15:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Nza a bu dehreh ambohroh mboh, shi wuwana nnoh ma aki nga agohsoh. kama kira nnoh andromboh ta a grehshi agohsoh amohnoh a te kohnoh nnoh tse kpeh. Kǝ rya nnoh tohmoh na te ndohmoh ata Ada nza a nga noh reh. Tasa za te kohnoh nnoh la ndohmoh ata nza ni te nnoh ma Ada reh a bu were kpeh.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s1">Dohsoh Hungroh Ma amboh Tufa Ma Urushalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Tsifa dohsoh hungroh tohmoh na ma amboh tufa ma Urushalima reh, lisa nnoh tswanza mya nza ni tsana ma amboh tufa ma Galatiyawa reh. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Ibi Lahadi, nambri ma amohnoh kǝ fufa hungroh anyinyi kǝ gya nnoh ma afiya tsifa wohroh, anyima na wuwana asabara a ŋoh. Mya tini ba bu te na amohnoh neh, te kama za dohsoh nnoh hungroh za kpeh. Seh nnoh kyangwri amboh anyi mata a de hungroh reh a na Urushalima. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Neh, nza meh ba bu niye, meh nati ŋa amgbasho bleh la mohnoh ni tohmoh nnoh kyangwri amboh anyi mata a de hungroh reh a na Urushalima. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Nza ni nza noh lele ma neh mya ti na mboh mata wa meh.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mya Ablusu Meh Kira Meh ti Ba na Amohnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Meh kira meh ti gǝga aki akpo afiya makidoniya, Meh kira meh ti te na amohnoh. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Meh nati tuma na amohnoh shidi ameh awo tana a gǝga, la ti shingi meh noh na awumu ata mya nza ni kira na hende ata tohmoh. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Meh sohroh kira mya ti nza noh shidi ma mya ti gǝga kpeh, meh kira mya ti te ibi amboh anyi na amohnoh nza Nnoh a kira. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Mya neh meh nati kasa ma akpo afya Afisa tama a kira Fentiko a treh feh. <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />Nnoh kǝ vuru meh atsi te ndohmoh na mareh, tasa kyangwri mboh gaga ma a sa ndohmoh amya a leke. <verse eid="1CO 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Nza Timoti ta na na , na amohnoh, de noh alindeh, kama kira nnoh andromboh ta a wa ŋoh aniye kpeh a leh a te ndohmoh Nnoh tswanza mya nza ni te za reh. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Nza a bu dehreh, akyo ta a kama a lisa ŋoh abibi kpeh, nza a nati a gyuru a ba a ŋoh shingi nnoh na awumu ata nza a kira. Mya meh bana ŋoh tasa atsi amboh tufa mboh. <verse eid="1CO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Ma ikpi tsifa atsi ambohroh Afolo, mya meh bleh ŋoh la ta a na na a te na amohnoh tasa mgbiri amboh tufa mboh. tana a bu gbalala a sohroh a kira la ŋoh ta a hehreh a na nehnehreh kpeh, a nati a ba nza tana ta a hunji avu reh. <verse eid="1CO 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Lisa nza noh feh, shi wuwana nnoh nimeh nga agohsoh, wuwa nnoh agohsoh, shi wuwana nnoh. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Lisa nnoh awumu nambri nimeh kira. <verse eid="1CO 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />mohnoh ni wina noh la Istifanus tasa afya a ŋoh nambri tama a bu amboh jiji nga agohsoh ma akpo afya Akaya, tasa tama a te ndohmoh ma kyangwri Nnoh mboh. Meh bleh noh, atsi mboh, <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />tufa nnoh tsifa amboh ika ata wohroh, tasa akyo ata nza a ba ba a shingi nnoh a te ndohmoh reh alindeh. <verse eid="1CO 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Meh nza nana mya nza ni nza Istifanus, tasa Fartinatusu, tasa Akaikusu, ma a tswanza a bu mohnoh ŋa ni ba nnoh na amya reh. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Mboh ma a shingi meh nga meh wuwana tswanza nza ma nga noh za reh. A zohhoh mata nga amboh ika wohroh agba.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsifa Ablusu Ata Trina Ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />amboh tufa ma kpra Agohmoh ata Asiya ma atsifa na amohnoh. Akila tasa Biriskila ma atsifa na amohnoh, tasa amboh tufa mboh nza maka a dohsohna ma afya amoh reh. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />amboh tufa mboh ma mareh ma atsifa na amohnoh nambri. Tsifa nnoh na itoh amohnoh na nana agohsoh ika ata amboh tufa Yeso mboh.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />A bu mya, Ablusu na ivoh amya meh ŋa tsifa na amohnoh.<verse eid="1CO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Nza akyo anyi a sohroh a kira na Ada kpeh, aniye abibi ta a tufa akyo wohroh. Ada ambohroh ba.<verse eid="1CO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Lisa alindeh ata Ada Yeso ta a bu na amohnoh.<verse eid="1CO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Meh kira na amohnoh amboh ata nza ni bu noh Kristi Yeso a ŋoh, tswanza mya. Avu dehreh.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>